  'tezcatlipoca', 'Tezcatlipoca', NULL, 'God of Darkness', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level warrior, 12th level ley line walker and stone master', 15, 'Diabolic', NULL, '6ft2in (human); 8ft long x5ft tall (giant jaguar); 20ft tall (giant bear)', '200 lbs (human); 500 lbs (jaguar); 6 tons (bear)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":22,"MA":23,"PS":48,"PP":24,"PE":25,"PB":17,"Spd":63}', 2300, 4000, 63000, 4000, 1000, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":7,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"roll":3,"damage":33}', 'Alt: 3 attacks by magic; +6 save vs magic, +5 vs psionics, +12 vs horror factor; HF 16 in bear form; MDC starts at 12,600 on Rifts Earth and grows with followers; silver weapons inflict MD, Millennium Tree weapons do double damage; also vulnerable to magic, psionics, MD weapons; can turn 1D6x100 dead/day; teleport 86%, dimensional teleport 80%; minions: cult of Jaguar People (werejaguars), can rift in 2,000-4,000 werejaguars plus other monsters/demons', NULL, 'All wilderness skills plus detect concealment, track humans, wilderness survival at 98%; Dragonese/Elven, Nahuatl, Quiche Mayan, Atlantean, Spanish, American plus 7 other languages at 98%; W.P. Sword; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts', 'Nightvision 3000ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/min, half damage from energy and fire, turns undead, teleports and dimension-teleports at high odds, shapeshifts at will.', 'All stone magic; All spells levels 1-4; Circle of Flame; Fly; Horrific Illusion; Call Lightning; Fire Ball; Impervious to Energy; Invulnerability; Agony; Life Drain; Sickness; Spoil; Banishment; Control/Enslave Entity; Close Rift', 'All sensitive powers; Bio-Manipulation; Hypnotic Suggestion; Possession; Mind Block Auto-Defense; Mind Bond', 'Transform into human, giant jaguar, or bear-headed giant (unlimited duration, changes at a thought); Power of Corruption (save vs magic 19+, escalating daily; usable twice per 24 hrs)', NULL, 'Mirror Shield (reveals a viewed person''s thoughts/emotions); Tezcatlipoca''s Sword (indestructible obsidian-bladed club)', NULL, 'Sadistic, jealous tyrant who tortures, corrupts and dominates mortals for pleasure and power.', 'Tlaloc; Huitzilopochtli; Xipe Totec; Mictla', 'Quetzalcoatl; Gods of Light; dragons', 'Aztec war/night god and shapeshifter (human, jaguar, bear forms); also called Yoalli Ehecatl and Yaotl; rules the pantheon through fear.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.19-20');
  'tlaloc', 'Tlaloc', NULL, 'God of Rains', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level water warlock, 10th level ley line walker', 15, 'Miscreant', NULL, '8ft (2.4m)', '650 lbs (290 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":25,"MA":21,"PS":35,"PP":21,"PE":23,"PB":4,"Spd":88}', 1600, 2000, 36000, 4000, 750, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":2,"damage":20}', 'Alt: 3 attacks by magic (prefers magic); +10 save vs horror factor, +5 vs magic, +6 vs psionics; MDC starts at 7,200 on Rifts Earth; flying Spd 220 (150 mph); teleport 75%, dimensional teleport 64%; can summon 1D6 lesser water elementals', NULL, 'Art, demon/monster lore, astronomy, advanced math, land navigation, wilderness survival at 98%; Nahuatl, Quiche Mayan, Spanish, English/American, Atlantean, French, Elemental at 98%; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt; Hand to Hand: Basic', 'Nightvision 200ft, turns invisible, sees invisible, unaffected by cold, half damage from electricity, bio-regenerates 2D6x10 MDC/min, teleports and dimension-teleports.', 'All water spells (15th level water warlock); All spells levels 1-5; Tongues; Impervious to Energy; Call Lightning; Wind Rush; Minor Curse; Negate Magic; Summon Fog; Protection Circle: Superior', 'All sensitive powers (equal to 6th level psychic)', 'Weather Control (create/stop rain in 100 mile radius, 3x/day; herd storms up to 2000 miles away); Breath of Sickness (disease-laden wind, 60ft range, save vs magic 17, usable 6x/day); Lightning Bolts (call lightning at will, no P.P.E. cost, 2 per melee round)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cruel, petty and fickle; torments mortals with disease and storms on a whim, scorning mercy toward them.', 'Tezcatlipoca; Chac', NULL, 'Aztec rain and storm god; unreliable and vindictive, alternating favor and punishment toward worshippers; allied with Tezcatlipoca''s plans.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.20-21');
  'huitzilopochtli', 'Huitzilopochtli', NULL, 'War God', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level warrior, 10th level ley line walker', 15, 'Anarchist', NULL, '9ft tall (2.7m)', '1000 lbs (450 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":21,"MA":21,"PS":45,"PP":23,"PE":24,"PB":12,"Spd":88}', 1000, 2000, 30000, 1000, NULL, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":9,"initiative":3,"strike":10,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"roll":6,"damage":30}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic; +6 save vs magic, +4 vs psionics, +10 vs horror factor; impervious to non-magic energy, heat, fire (magic energy does full damage); MDC starts at 6,000 on Rifts Earth; commands ~1000 demigod-like Aztec warriors in feather armor (200 MDC each); Psionic Knowledge: None', NULL, 'All espionage/wilderness skills, prowl, demon lore, singing at 98%; literate in Nahuatl, Quiche Mayan, Dragonese/Elven, Spanish, American, Atlantean; knows ALL ancient/modern W.P.s plus boxing, wrestling, swimming, athletics; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts', 'Night vision 100ft, sees all light spectrums (infrared/UV), sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 2D6x10 MDC/min, turns undead, teleports and dimension-teleports.', 'All spells levels 1-2; Armor of Ithan; Magic Net; Escape; Energy Disruption; Apparition; Fire Ball; Impervious to Energy; Invulnerability; Swim as a Fish; Dimensional Portal; Close Rift', NULL, 'Radiate Light (300ft radius, 1D6x10 MD/melee to vampires in range, -2 to attacks/defense for vampires nearby); Eye/Mouth/Finger Beam (1D6 S.D.C. up to 1D6x10 M.D., range 2000ft, double vs vampires)', NULL, 'Xiuhcoatl (Turquoise Snake) war club, breathes flame; Huitzilopochtli''s Shield (indestructible, +3 parry, returns when thrown); Hummingbird-feather armor (1000 M.D.C.)', NULL, 'Proud warrior who scorns ranged weapons and cowardice, respects skilled fighters, and stays loyal to his pantheon.', 'warrior gods; godlings; demigods; dragons; True Atlanteans', 'vampires', 'Aztec war and sun god; least eager of the pantheon to reconquer Earth but still defends it; opposes vampires on principle.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.22-23');
  'quetzalcoatl', 'Quetzalcoatl', NULL, 'The Rebel, The Ancient Feathered Serpent; also known as Ehecatl (the wind)', 'rifts', 'Dragon god', '20th level ley line walker and scholar, 8th level temporal wizard', 20, 'Principled', NULL, '6ft5in (human form); 12ft long, 20ft wingspan (dragon form)', '200 lbs (human) or 2000 lbs (dragon)', '{"IQ":25,"ME":26,"MA":24,"PS":36,"PP":25,"PE":28,"PB":19,"Spd":60}', 2000, 5000, 70000, 9000, 1200, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":8,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"roll":4,"damage":21}', 'Alt: 4 breath + 3 physical attacks, or 3 by magic; +8 save vs horror factor, +11 vs magic, +10 vs psionics; MDC starts at 14,000 on Rifts Earth; flying Spd 250 (170 mph); teleport 88%, dimensional teleport 88%; metamorphosis to human form at will, no limit; weapons/equipment: usually none, relies on magic and cunning', NULL, 'All science, technical, medical skills, fishing, dancing, singing, detect ambush/concealment, tracking, wilderness survival at 98%; speaks/reads all languages through magic; W.P. Sword, Blunt, Energy Rifle, Heavy Energy Weapons; Hand to Hand: Expert', 'Nightvision 200ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 2D6x10 MDC/min, resists fire and cold (half damage), teleports at 88%, shifts to human form at will.', 'All spells levels 1-15; All temporal magic spells', 'All sensitive, physical and healing powers; Bio-Manipulation; Group Mind Block', 'Healing Touch (restores 4D6 S.D.C./HP or 2D6 M.D.C.); Resurrection (80% chance)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Wise, compassionate teacher of humankind, with a rare hidden temper when exhausted, frustrated, or corrupted.', NULL, NULL, 'Elder Kukulcan dragon who ascended to godhood as protector of humans; was once magically corrupted, and now opposes his old rival''s return.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.23-24');
  'xolotl', 'Xolotl', NULL, 'The Ally of Quetzalcoatl', 'rifts', 'Deity', '14th level ley line walker', 14, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6ft tall (1.8m)', '180 lbs (81 kg)', '{"IQ":25,"ME":20,"MA":20,"PS":30,"PP":23,"PE":21,"PB":15,"Spd":44}', 500, 800, 13000, 2000, NULL, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":6,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":6,"roll":4,"damage":15}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic; +8 save vs horror factor, +4 vs magic, +4 vs psionics; MDC starts at 2,600 on Rifts Earth; teleport 76%, dimensional teleport 70%; never tires, leaps 30ft high/long; keen vision, hearing, smell; Psionic Knowledge: None', '[{"name":"Prowl","pct":88}]', 'Tracking humans/animals, art, dancing, anthropology, demon lore, faerie lore, land navigation, hunting, wilderness survival at 98%; W.P. archery/targeting, sword, energy rifle; magically knows all languages; Hand to Hand: Basic', 'Nightvision 60ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 1D4x10 MDC/min, half damage from energy/fire, teleports, leaps 30ft, keen senses.', 'All spells levels 1-15 (14th level of experience)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Curious, inquisitive scholar of magic who defends non-humans and mutants, disliking prejudice based on appearance.', 'Quetzalcoatl', NULL, 'Dog-headed god, Quetzalcoatl''s closest friend and companion on many quests; wants to help dog-boys and other mutant animals.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.25');
  'xipe-totec', 'Xipe Totec', 'Xipo Totec', 'God of Flaying; Our Lord, the Flayed One', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level ley line walker and 10th level stone master', 15, 'Diabolic', NULL, '6ft6in (1.9m)', '250 lbs (112.5 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":20,"MA":20,"PS":28,"PP":21,"PE":20,"PB":9,"Spd":38}', 1000, 2000, 30000, 3000, 600, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":9,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3,"damage":13}', 'Alt: 3 attacks by magic; +14 save vs horror factor, +4 vs magic, +4 vs psionics; MDC starts at 6,000 on Rifts Earth; impervious to poison/disease; half damage from energy/fire; teleport 84%, dimensional teleport 80%', NULL, 'Identify plants/fruits, botany, preserve food, skin/prepare hides, land navigation, demon/monster lore, advanced math at 98%; W.P. knife, sword; Nahuatl, Dragonese/Elven, Quiche Mayan, Spanish, Atlantean at 98% or tongues spell; Hand to Hand: Assassin', 'Nightvision 300ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 3D4x10 MDC/min, impervious to poison and disease, half damage from energy/fire, teleports.', 'All stone magic; All wizard spells levels 1-7; Commune with Spirits; Hallucination; Negate Magic; Spoil; Summon and Control Canines; Control/Enslave Entity; Anti-Magic Cloud; Metamorphosis: Mist; Calm Storms; Summon Rain; Summon Storm; Summon Lesser Being', 'All sensitive powers; Bio-Manipulation; Psychic Surgery', 'Aura of Fertility (1000 mile radius, makes land fruitful or infertile)', NULL, 'Enchanted obsidian knife (6D6 S.D.C. to mortals or 6D6+6 M.D.)', NULL, 'Morbid sadist who demands blood sacrifice, enjoys possession and torment, and calls mass murder a fair trade.', 'necromancers; dark cults; demons; evil entities', NULL, 'Aztec fertility and flaying god who wears a cloak of human skin; runs secret cults and may have influenced Adolf Hitler.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.25-26');
  'xochiquetzal', 'Xochiquetzal', NULL, 'Goddess of Beauty', 'rifts', 'Deity', '10th level ley line walker', 10, 'Anarchist (was once Unprincipled)', NULL, '5ft6in (1.6m)', '110 lbs (49.5 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":18,"MA":24,"PS":18,"PP":19,"PE":20,"PB":26,"Spd":24}', 300, 300, 6000, 1000, NULL, NULL, 10, '{"attacks":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":4,"roll":4,"damage":2}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic; +4 save vs magic, +4 vs psionics; MDC starts at 1,200 on Rifts Earth; Psionic Knowledge: None', NULL, 'All domestic and botany skills, recognize plants/fruits, holistic medicine, horsemanship, wilderness survival at 98%; speaks/reads Nahuatl, Spanish, Dragonese/Elven; Hand to Hand: Basic', 'Night vision 200ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 1D6x10 MDC/min.', 'All spells levels 1-4; Minor Curse; Purification; Water to Wine; Remove Curse', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Outwardly cheerful and queenly, but secretly miserable and vengeful toward the gods who ruled her life.', NULL, NULL, 'Aztec goddess of flowers and love, passed between Tlaloc and Tezcatlipoca as a forced wife; secretly loves Quetzalcoatl and seeks escape.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.26-27');
  'cihuacoatl', 'Cihuacoatl', NULL, 'Earth Goddess, Mother of the Gods; also known as Coatlicue', 'rifts', 'Deity', '16th level earth warlock, 12th level stone master and 8th level ley line walker/wizard', 16, 'Miscreant', NULL, '12ft (3.66m) natural form; 5ft4in (1.63m) human form', '2 tons (natural form) or 100 lbs (human form)', '{"IQ":23,"ME":27,"MA":22,"PS":40,"PP":19,"PE":20,"PB":4,"Spd":66}', 800, 500, 50000, 6000, NULL, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":4,"strike":6,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":4,"damage":25}', 'Alt: 3 attacks by magic; +4 to strike with hands (vs +6 to strike/bite with either head, used as primary); +3 save vs magic, +7 vs psionics; HF 17 applies in natural form; MDC starts at 10,000 on Rifts Earth; impervious to poison/disease, half damage from energy/fire; turns 1D6x100 dead/day; teleport 80%, dimensional teleport 76%; summons 2D4 lesser earth elementals or 1 greater elemental; commands up to 4,000 Naga warriors; transforms into a beautiful woman (P.B. 21) at will; Psionic Knowledge: none other than hypnotic gaze', NULL, 'All domestic/wilderness skills, botany, herbology, art, demon lore, detect ambush, tracking, wilderness survival at 98%; literate in Dragonese/Elven, Nahuatl, Quiche Mayan, Atlantean, Spanish, American, Kittani at 98%; Hand to Hand: Basic', 'Nightvision 3000ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/min, impervious to poison/disease, half damage from energy/fire, teleports, shifts to human form.', 'All elemental earth spells (16th level); All stone magic (12th level); All spells levels 1-5; Fire Ball; Time Slip; Tongues; Life Drain; Luck Curse; Sickness; Spoil; Wisps of Confusion; Speed of the Snail; Summon Entity; Time Hole; Close Rift', NULL, 'Hypnotic Gaze (psionic, saves at -4, victim rendered passive unless attacked first); Summon and Control Snakes (1D4x100)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Haughty, arrogant matriarch who prefers to terrorize and devour mortals rather than deal with them.', 'Splugorth; Splynncryth',