  'nahualli', 'Nahualli', 'Aristophanes', 'the Sorcerer', 'rifts', 'True Atlantean', '9th level stone master', 9, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '6 ft 7 in (2.0 m)', '210 lbs (94.5 kg)', '{"IQ":15,"ME":20,"MA":15,"PS":21,"PP":14,"PE":17,"PB":16,"Spd":16}', 51, 147, NULL, 167, NULL, NULL, 10, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":5}', '+3 S.D.C. damage; +4 save vs horror factor; +2 save vs magic; +3 save vs psionics; alt attack: two by magic; M.D.C. by armor or magic only (none of his own).', '[{"name":"Basic and advanced math","pct":98},{"name":"Astronomy","pct":85},{"name":"Lore: Demons and Monsters","pct":80},{"name":"Lore: Faerie","pct":80},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":82},{"name":"Operate Dimensional Pyramids","pct":85},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":95},{"name":"Language: Greek","pct":95},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":95},{"name":"Language: American","pct":95}]', 'Archaeology (no % printed alongside it); Literate in Atlantean, Dragonese; W.P. Sword, W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Automatic Pistol; athletics; boxing; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Senses vampires (1000 ft), ley lines, and rifts; ley line phasing (all as a ley line walker); cannot be transformed by magic; extended lifespan.', 'All stone magic (incl. gem powers); Gems: 1D4 each of 2D6 types carried; Tattoo: Heart Impaled by Stake (immune to vampire bite/mind control); Tattoo: Flaming Sword (1D8 M.D.); Tattoo: Simple Animal - Cheetah servant; Tattoo: Heart Encircled in Chains (675 M.D.C. aura); Tattoo: Eyes - Three (nightvision 1200 ft, see invisible/aura); Tattoo: Monster - Gryphon servant (86 M.D.C.)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Several TW anti-vampire devices (water guns, light sources); Silver plated sword; Silver cross; Stakes and a mallet', NULL, 'Mysterious, bold persona hides a congenial man secretly ashamed of once fleeing from a vampire intelligence.', 'Corellion/Quetzalcoatl; Sons of Quetzalcoatl', 'Vampires; Vampire intelligences', 'A True Atlantean stone master