  'cihuateto', 'Cihuateto', 'Jennifer Flores', NULL, 'rifts', 'Secondary Vampire (formerly human)', '8th level secondary vampire', 8, 'Anarchist', NULL, '5 ft 3 in (1.6 m)', '130 lbs (58.5 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":24,"MA":16,"PS":27,"PP":21,"PE":17,"PB":12,"Spd":22}', 100, NULL, NULL, 20, 80, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"roll":3}', '+12 S.D.C. damage; +5 save vs horror factor; +3 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics; +8 save vs psionic mind control; +6 save vs magic mind control; alt attack: two by psionics plus one hand to hand; P.S. supernatural; M.D.C.: None (uses Hit Points).', '[{"name":"Tracking","pct":25},{"name":"Prowl","pct":50},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98}]', 'W.P. Knife, W.P. Sword; Combat Skills: Natural.', 'Nightvision 1600 ft, smells blood a mile off, no breath/bleed/heat, regenerates 2D6 HP/melee, full regrowth in 8 hrs, immune to poison/disease/sleep/paralysis, shape shifts wolf/bat/mist.', NULL, 'Death trance; Alter aura (self); Empathy; Mind block; Presence sense; Sense evil; Deaden pain; Induce sleep; Hypnotic suggestion; Super-hypnotic suggestion', NULL, NULL, 'Varies; skilled with TW anti-vampire weapons', NULL, 'A tragic figure who knows she is doomed, fighting her own undead nature to destroy fellow vampires.', 'Sons of Quetzalcoatl; Janelle; Julian/Huitzilopochtli; an unidentified benefactor (possibly a deity)', 'The vampire kingdom of Mexico City; Her vampire creator (a master vampire)', 'A former human vampire hunter turned secondary vampire, now an undercover spy in the Mexico City vampire kingdom.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.35-36');
  'huitzilopochtli-of-the-sons', 'Huitzilopochtli', 'Julian Mercado', 'the Warrior of the Sons', 'rifts', 'Modified human (Full Conversion Cyborg/Borg)', '6th level Borg', 6, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '9 ft (2.7 m)', '1200 lbs (540 kg)', '{"IQ":12,"ME":16,"MA":12,"PS":28,"PP":24,"PE":16,"PB":4,"Spd":132}', NULL, NULL, 280, 3, NULL, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":3,"strike":7,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"roll":4}', '+13 S.D.C. damage; +3 save vs magic; impervious to psionic see aura and bio-manipulation; +420 M.D.C. from HI-B3 Heavy Infantry Armor (worn, not innate); Horror Factor 12 - ''he''s BIG and menacing looking.''', '[{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":85},{"name":"Pilot Hovercraft","pct":90},{"name":"Pilot Tank and APC","pct":70},{"name":"Read Sensory Equipment","pct":70},{"name":"Weapon Systems","pct":75},{"name":"Climbing","pct":75},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98}]', 'W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Heavy, W.P. Knife; wrestling; athletics; Hand to Hand: Expert.', 'Immune to the vampire''s slow-kill bite; fully cybernetic senses, strength, and weapon systems replace his lost human body.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Multi-optic eye (polarized filters); Fully loaded sensor hand (left); Forearm particle beam (right arm); Silver plated knuckle blades (retractable, both hands); Silver plated wrist needle (right arm); Chemical spray (chest; water or holy water); Built-in radio receiver/transmitter; Built-in loudspeaker; Gyro-compass; Bionic link with gas filter and oxygen storage cell; Headjack and amplified hearing; Concealed laser rod (right leg); Secret compartment (left leg)', 'Colt .45 (silver bullets); Water cannon; Stakes cut like knives; Coalition C-27 heavy plasma cannon; Neural mace', NULL, 'A friendly, wry-humored, trustworthy man inside a fearsome cyborg body, close to fellow vampire-hunter Jennifer.', 'Sons of Quetzalcoatl; Corellion/Quetzalcoatl; Jennifer/Cihuateto', 'Vampires; Sir Raoul Lazarious (former Ranger, falling out)', 'A full-conversion cyborg vampire hunter, formerly caravan leader Julian Mercado, rebuilt after vampires crippled him; armor painted as the war god.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.36-38');
  'xolotl-of-the-sons', 'Xolotl', 'Ricky the Dog', 'of the Sons', 'rifts', 'German Shepherd Dog Boy', '9th level Dog Boy', 9, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '5 ft 10 in (1.8 m)', '170 lbs (76.5 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":11,"MA":15,"PS":20,"PP":15,"PE":19,"PB":13,"Spd":33}', 59, 75, NULL, 4, 149, NULL, 9, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+2 save vs horror factor; +2 save vs magic; +1 save vs psionics; M.D.C. from body armor only (Dog Boy armor 30 M.D.C.).', '[{"name":"Intelligence","pct":74},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Hovercraft","pct":98},{"name":"Read Sensory Equipment","pct":85},{"name":"Weapon Systems","pct":95},{"name":"Climbing","pct":95},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":65}]', 'Running, land navigation, wilderness survival, hunting, athletics, wrestling; W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Sword, W.P. Knife; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Senses psychic/magic energy (50 ft), senses supernatural beings (80%), superior smell, keen hearing (standard Dog Boy O.C.C. senses).', NULL, 'Sense evil; Sense magic; Sixth sense; Empathy; Telepathy', NULL, NULL, 'Portable water cannon; Metal water shotgun; C-14 rifle/grenade launcher; C-18 laser pistol; Pair of vibro-swords; Silver dagger; Wooden cross; Dog Boy armor (30 M.D.C.); A stolen suit of SAMAS armor', NULL, 'Friendly and loyal to friends, deadly to enemies; instinctively wary of the team''s renegade vampire.', 'Janelle; Julian/Huitzilopochtli; Corellion/Quetzalcoatl; Sons of Quetzalcoatl', 'Coalition States (former masters); Vampires', 'A German Shepherd Dog Boy who deserted the Coalition States and became an anti-vampire specialist for the Sons of Quetzalcoatl.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.38');
  'anu', 'Anu', NULL, 'The Sky God', 'rifts', 'God/alien intelligence hybrid', '18th level shifter, 15th level ley line walker, 12th level mind melter', 18, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6 ft (1.8 m) in humanoid form; 20 ft x 10 ft (6 x 3 m) fleshy mound with tentacles in monster form', '200 lbs (90 kg) human form; 25 tons monstrous form', '{"IQ":21,"ME":29,"MA":19,"PS":40,"PP":19,"PE":30,"PB":18,"Spd":44}', 2000, 5000, 70000, 5000, 1500, NULL, 10, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":10,"strike":5,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'MDC 35,000 on Rifts Earth (doesn''t need worshippers); cannot be surprised/attacked from behind in monster form; +25 S.D.C. damage; +12 save vs horror factor; +9 save vs magic; +8 save vs psionics; P.S. supernatural; Horror Factor 17 in monster form (10 in human form); 7 attacks in monster form, or 3 by magic in either form; P.B. printed as ''18(4)'', second value unclear. Special: summons 1D4 greater and/or 4D6 lesser air elementals, sees/speaks to all air elementals.', NULL, 'Generally not applicable - a primordial force of nature. Magically knows all languages, all lore, and any skill he finds useful, all at 90%. Combat Skills: Natural Abilities.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft, sees all light spectrums and 4th-dimension beings, sees through illusions/invisible, bio-regens 3D6x10 M.D./round, resists fire/cold, immune to poison/disease, turns undead, teleports, floats, fragments into possessing essences.', 'All magic spells levels 1-15', 'All sensitive psi-powers; All super psi-powers', NULL, NULL, 'None; relies entirely on his powers (can create a psi-sword per tentacle - text says six tentacles, description says seven)', NULL, 'Distracted and detached in human form, calmly ruthless, unbothered by casually crushing an annoying mortal.', NULL, 'Splugorth (kept under observation); Vampires and alien intelligences (as a pantheon policy)', 'The alien-intelligence-descended original sky god of the Sumerian pantheon, deposed as leader by his son Marduk.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.39-40');
  'enlil', 'Enlil', 'Bel Enlil', 'The Wind God', 'rifts', 'Deity (chapter heading ''Babylonian Gods''; no Species line printed)', '18th level air warlock, 10th level ley line walker', 18, 'Unprincipled', NULL, 'Varies at will, 7-14 ft tall (2.1 to 4.3 m)', '300 to 2,000 lbs (135 to 900 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":22,"MA":19,"PS":43,"PP":26,"PE":21,"PB":21,"Spd":44}', 2000, 4300, 63000, 2000, 1000, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":8,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"pull":2,"roll":2}', 'MDC 12,600 on Rifts Earth; +28 S.D.C. damage; +4 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics; P.S. supernatural; Spd 160 (109 mph/174 kmph) flying; 3 attacks by magic (alt). Special: Weather Control - storms as a 20th-level caster, 6x/24 hrs, free; summons lightning 6x/day (1D6 to 1D6x10 M.D., range 2000 ft), changes wind at will, always knows his location. Special: summons 1D6 lesser air elementals at will; could field 2D6x1,000 lesser + 2D4x10 greater air elementals if the Council of Sumer ordered it.', '[{"name":"Astronomy","pct":98},{"name":"Space Navigation","pct":98},{"name":"Mathematics","pct":98},{"name":"Art","pct":98},{"name":"Demon Lore","pct":98},{"name":"Prowl","pct":98},{"name":"Palming","pct":98},{"name":"Pick Pocket","pct":98},{"name":"Climbing","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Akkadian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Assyrian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Sumerian","pct":98}]', 'All wilderness skills at 98%; plus 12 other languages at 98%; W.P. Sword, W.P. Spear, W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Expert.', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees invisible and elementals, bio-regens 1D4x100 M.D./min, immune to electricity, resists energy, turns undead, teleports, flies at will; healing touch 4D6 HP/S.D.C./M.D.C.', 'All elemental air spells (18th level); All spells levels 1-4; Calling; Wind rush; Call lightning; Impervious to energy; Energy disruption; Horrific illusion; Time slip; Tongues; Eyes of Thoth; Luck curse; Minor curse; Curse: phobia; Banishment; Summon fog; Calm storm; Anti-magic cloud', 'All sensitive powers; Empathic transmission; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense; Hydrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Sword of the Sky (rune weapon: I.Q. 11, telepathic link to Enlil, Scrupulous alignment, burns evil touch for 1D4x10 M.D., casts water elemental spells 6x/day at 10th-level water warlock, mega-damage 2D4x10 M.D. - double vs supernatural intelligences and vampires, lightning bolt 1D6x10 M.D. range 2000 ft)', NULL, 'Moody and impulsive, alternating floods and calm on a whim; loyal to Anu; fears but still fights alien intelligences.', 'High Council of Sumer (Anu, Enki, Marduk)', 'Splugorth; Old Ones; Vampires; Lord Splynncryth', 'The Sumerian wind god, Anu''s eldest son and enforcer, serving on the High Council of Sumer beneath Marduk.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.40-42');
  'enki', 'Enki', NULL, 'God of Magic', 'rifts', 'Deity (chapter heading ''Babylonian Gods''; no Species line printed)', '20th level ley line walker and water warlock, 12th level shifter, diabolist and scholar', 20, 'Scrupulous', NULL, 'Varies at will, 6 to 24 ft tall (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":26,"ME":25,"MA":26,"PS":37,"PP":23,"PE":24,"PB":21,"Spd":66}', 2400, 5000, 74000, 8000, 450, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":6,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'MDC 14,800 on Rifts Earth; +22 S.D.C. damage; +10 save vs horror factor; +6 save vs magic; +7 save vs psionics; P.S. supernatural; Horror Factor 15 = awe to good beings, horror to evil ones; 3 attacks by magic (alt). Special: Magic Control - anti-magic cloud or sanctum as a 20th-level mage, free, once every two hours. Also known as Ea, Abzu (confusable with Apsu, also called Abzu), Nudimmud, and En-uru.', '[{"name":"Computer Hacking","pct":98},{"name":"Cryptography","pct":98},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":98},{"name":"Surveillance Systems","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Boats","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Automobiles","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Motorcycles","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot Hover Vehicles","pct":98}]', 'All science, technical, pilot-related, and domestic skills at 98% (umbrella); W.P. Sword, W.P. Spear; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 2000 ft, sees/turns invisible, swims like a dolphin, breathes underwater, bio-regens 1D4x100 M.D./min, turns undead; healing touch 1D6x10 HP/S.D.C./M.D.C.', 'All spell magic incl. spells of legend; All water elemental magic (20th level); All circles and wards (16th level)', 'All sensitive powers (10th level); All physical powers (10th level)', NULL, NULL, 'None; relies mostly on his magic and wits', NULL, 'Friendly, caring father figure, more approachable than Marduk; travels Rifts Earth in disguise to study techno-wizardry.', 'Marduk (son); Enlil; Damkina (wife); High Council of Sumer', 'Apsu; Tiamat', 'The Sumerian god of magic and water who rebelled against Apsu and Tiamat and fathered Marduk with his wife Damkina.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.42-43');
  'marduk', 'Marduk', 'Bel Marduk', 'Lord of the Gods', 'rifts', 'Deity (chapter heading ''Babylonian Gods''; no Species line printed)', '20th level air and water warlock, 16th level ley line walker, and 10th level shifter', 20, 'Principled good', NULL, 'Ranges from 6 to 24 ft (1.8 m to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":23,"ME":28,"MA":24,"PS":50,"PP":22,"PE":26,"PB":19,"Spd":88}', 2000, 6000, 80000, 10000, 800, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":3,"strike":6,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'MDC 16,000 on Rifts Earth; without the Tablets of Destiny he would have 60,000 M.D.C. (12,000 on Rifts Earth); +35 S.D.C. damage; +12 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic; +8 save vs psionics; P.S. supernatural; Horror Factor 16 = awe to good beings, horror to evil ones; 3 attacks by magic (alt). Special: Wind Blasts 2D6x10 M.D., range 4,000 ft, counts as one melee attack. Commonly called Bel Marduk; said to have 50 secret names, all of which must be known to work True-Name magic on him (''SO'' in the source text is the digit-cipher form of ''50'').', '[{"name":"Art","pct":98},{"name":"Lore: Demons and Monsters","pct":98},{"name":"Astronomy","pct":98}]', 'All wilderness skills at 98%; magically knows all languages; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Chain, W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regens 1D6x100 M.D./min, resists fire/cold, immune to poison/disease, turns undead, teleports; healing touch 1D6x10 HP/S.D.C./M.D.C.', 'All air and water spells; All magic spells levels 1-15 incl. spells of legend', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, 'Scepter of Power (greatest rune weapon: I.Q. 15, telepathic link to Marduk, indestructible, burns evil touch, casts calm storm/summon storm/close rift/banishment/rain dance 3x/day at 10th-level sorcerer, starts ley line storms at a nexus, 2D4x10 M.D. as a weapon); Spear of Lightning (1D6x10 M.D., call lightning for 1D4x10 M.D., returns when thrown, range 1000 ft); Marduk''s Net (entangles, -4 to all combat bonuses, holds P.S. 60 or less, blocks teleport at -60%); Marduk''s Bow (1D6x10 M.D. arrows, range 4000 ft); The Tablets of Destiny (doubles M.D.C./converts mortals to M.D.C., +1 save vs magic, +20,000 M.D.C. to godlike beings, grants all languages and understanding of any magic/device, glimpses of the future)', NULL, 'A wise, compassionate, and courageous king who values good advice from anyone and fights for his principles.', 'Ra; Apollo; Isis; Ahura Mazda; Brahma; Quetzalcoatl; Enki; Enlil', 'Splugorth; Tiamat; Apsu; The Queen of Dragons', 'Chief deity of the Babylonian pantheon, son of Enki, who single combated and imprisoned Tiamat before taking the Tablets of Destiny.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.43-44');
  'tammuz', 'Tammuz', NULL, 'of the Soil', 'rifts', 'Deity', '12th level water warlock and 8th level dryad (see Rifts England)', 12, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8-7.3 m) (printed as Size)', 'Varies with size.', '{"IQ":19,"ME":17,"MA":18,"PS":24,"PP":18,"PE":22,"PB":25,"Spd":33}', 1000, 2000, 30000, 2000, NULL, NULL, 11, '{"attacks":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'MDC 6,000 on Rifts Earth; +9 to S.D.C. damage; +5 save vs horror factor; +5 save vs magic; +2 save vs psionics; Special Fertility Aura: ensures crops in a 24 mile radius, doubled per 100/500+ P.P.E. spent, farmlands yield 50+4D6% more.', '[{"name":"Herbology","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":98},{"name":"Sail Boat","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98}]', 'All domestic and wilderness skills at 98%; all languages of the ancient Near East and 10 Earth languages at 98%; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees invisible, bio-regenerates 2D6x10 MDC/melee, teleports self 62%/dimensional 51%; fertility aura boosts crop yields over an expandable radius.', 'All warlock water spells; All dryad magic; Prepare magical herbs', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Friendly and outgoing but shallow, timid and self-centered; loves parties, flattery and attention.', NULL, NULL, 'Sumerian fertility god, husband of Ishtar, also called Dummuzi; handsome, easygoing dryad-warlock who guarantees bountiful harvests.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.46');
  'apsu', 'Apsu', NULL, 'Of The Abyss', 'rifts', 'Alien Intelligence', '20th level ley line walker and master of bio-wizardry (see Rifts Atlantis) and temporal magic (see Rifts England)', 20, 'Diabolic', NULL, '40 feet (12 m) in diameter and 20 feet (6 m) tall', '75 tons', '{"IQ":27,"ME":30,"MA":22,"PS":70,"PP":24,"PE":30,"PB":3,"Spd":88}', 5000, 20000, 250000, 12000, 2000, NULL, 19, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":2,"strike":6,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":1}', 'Alt: 5 attacks by magic or psionics. M.D.C. reduced to about 95,000 for a month if he awakens, then regrows to 250,000 (not reduced on Rifts Earth). +15 save vs horror factor, +8 save vs magic, +8 save vs psionics. Semi-indestructible: kinetic attacks do 1/10 damage unless magical weapons; non-magical energy does 1/4 damage; impervious to heat/cold/disease/poison, does not breathe. Vulnerable: double damage from good rune weapons and silver S.D.C. weapons; 10x damage from Millennium Tree weapons. Must be reduced to -1000 M.D.C. to kill; at 0 M.D.C. bonuses/attacks halved; flees at 30,000 M.D.C. or less.', NULL, 'Most skills not applicable; magically knows all languages and lores at 98%.', 'Nightvision 2000 ft, sees/turns invisible, regenerates 1D4x100 MDC/melee, teleports self 93%/dimensional 89%; engulf attack traps and drowns foes; senses events on Earth even while dormant.', 'All spells levels 1-15; Spells of legend; All temporal magic spells; Bio-wizardry secrets (excluding rune weapon creation)', 'All sensitive powers; Empathic Transmission; Mind Block Auto-Defense; Bio-Manipulation', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purely evil and exploitative toward mortals; bullying toward gods, diplomatic only when facing a true equal.', NULL, NULL, 'A shapeless, dormant alien intelligence posing as a god, a P.P.E. vampire who once ruled by terror until Enki subdued him.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.47-48');
  'tiamat', 'Tiamat', NULL, NULL, 'rifts', 'Unique monster of unknown origin', '18th level ley line walker', 18, 'Diabolic', NULL, '300 foot long (95 m) serpent', '60 tons', '{"IQ":26,"ME":23,"MA":22,"PS":60,"PP":19,"PE":26,"PB":3,"Spd":88}', 1000, 5000, 60000, 6000, 200, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":2,"strike":6,"parry":10,"dodge":6,"roll":4}', 'Alt: 3 attacks by magic. M.D.C. reduced to 30,000 on Rifts Earth. +12 save vs horror factor, +8 save vs magic, +8 save vs psionics.', NULL, 'Generally not applicable; knows demon/monster lore at 98%; Combat Skills: Natural Ability.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft, sees invisible, regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/melee, doesn''t breathe, swims, resists energy, immune to poison/disease/potions, animates/turns 1D6x100 dead, teleports self 96%/dimensional 91%; seven prehensile head tentacles.', 'All spells levels 1-15', 'All sensitive powers; Empathic Transmission', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Utterly without compassion, an eater of flesh and drinker of emotions; even her own demons fear her volatile temper.', 'Other evil gods; Dragons; Demon lords; Forces of evil; Ahriman (considered but wary alliance)', NULL, 'A giant metallic-red serpent-goddess, Apsu''s former consort, hibernating after defeat by Marduk while secretly rebuilding power on Rifts Earth.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.48-49');
  'mummu', 'Mummu', NULL, 'The Maker', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level craftsman/engineer, 15th level stone master, 15th level ley line walker, 6th level techno-wizard', 20, 'Miscreant', NULL, '5 feet, 4 inches tall (1.63 m)', '200 lbs (90 kg)', '{"IQ":28,"ME":19,"MA":19,"PS":30,"PP":18,"PE":19,"PB":14,"Spd":44}', 1000, 2500, 35000, 1700, NULL, NULL, 9, '{"attacks":5,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic. M.D.C. reduced to 6,000 on Rifts Earth. +15 to S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs horror factor; +3 save vs magic; +3 save vs psionics. Horror Factor only applies once his godly identity is revealed.', NULL, 'All technical, scientific, mechanical, electrical and computer skills at 98%; Robot Combat: Basic; magically knows all languages; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/minute, resists fire, teleports self 74%/dimensional 53%; a born craftsman and mechanic.', 'All stone magic; All spells levels 1-7; Negate Magic; Mystic Portal; Anti-Magic Cloud', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Techno-wizard SAMAS armor pair (main body 750 M.D.C., tripled by enchantment; spells: Armor of Ithan, Invulnerability, Chameleon, Invisibility, Impervious to Energy, all at 10th level; repainted red and gold; bounty exists for the Man in Red Armor); Techno-wizard rail gun (variant of TK-Machinegun, 2D4x10 M.D. per burst, holds 20 bursts, telekinesis spell or 20 I.S.P. recharges 4 bursts)', NULL, 'Servile toward the powerful, bullying toward those beneath him, and quietly willing to betray Tiamat for a better deal.', NULL, NULL, 'Once-mighty god of craftsmanship, now Enki''s outwardly loyal servant while secretly spying for Tiamat and Lord Splynncryth.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.49-51');
  'kingu', 'Kingu', NULL, 'The Chosen', 'rifts', 'Unique demon-vampire intelligence hybrid', '15th level ley line walker and shifter; 12th level vampire', 15, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Seven feet (2.1 m) tall', '400 lbs (180 kg)', '{"IQ":26,"ME":28,"MA":18,"PS":40,"PP":18,"PE":26,"PB":6,"Spd":44}', 200, 700, 9000, 1000, 500, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":8,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic or psionics. M.D.C. does not change on Rifts Earth. +25 to S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic; +8 save vs psionics.', NULL, 'All rogue and wilderness skills at 86%; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Superior/night/infrared/UV vision, smells blood 2 miles away, regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/minute; vampire shapeshifting (wolf, bat, mist), near-invulnerable except to magic, wood, silver, running or holy water; weakened by sunlight.', 'All spells levels 1-4; Energy Disruption; Call Lightning; Dispel Magic Barrier; Fly as the Eagle', 'Death Trance; Alter Aura (self); Empathy; Mind Block; Hypnotic Suggestion; Presence Sense; Sense Evil; Deaden Pain; Induce Sleep; Super-Hypnotic Suggestion', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Icily controlled rage that erupts violently at the smallest annoyance; hates Marduk and all good-aligned beings.', NULL, 'Marduk', 'Tiamat''s executed demon champion, revived as a demon-vampire hybrid seeking revenge and the recovery of the Tablets of Destiny.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.51-52');
  'ereshkigal', 'Ereshkigal', NULL, 'Goddess of the Underworld', 'rifts', 'Deity', '16th level ley line walker and 12th level necromancer (see Rifts Africa)', 16, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Varies from 7 to 24 feet (2.1-7.3 m); usually a 12 foot (3.6 m) tall woman with pointed teeth', 'Varies with height.', '{"IQ":20,"ME":27,"MA":21,"PS":40,"PP":22,"PE":30,"PB":14,"Spd":88}', 1000, 3000, 40000, 5000, 300, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":5,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":4}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic. M.D.C. reduced to 8,000 on Rifts Earth (rarely leaves her domain). +25 to S.D.C. damage; +9 save vs magic; +7 save vs psionics. Visiting gods have M.D.C. divided by five in her realm (alien intelligences and vampires unaffected); teleportation in her realm at -80% except entering (+20%); only she can open a rift within her domain.', NULL, 'All espionage and technical skills at 98%; magically knows all languages; W.P. Knife, W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft, sees invisible, regenerates 4D6x10 MDC/minute (more in her realm), resists fire/cold, animates/turns 1D6x100 dead, teleports self 89%/dimensional 73%. Healing touch restores 1D4x10 H.P./S.D.C. or M.D.C.', 'All necromantic spells; All spells levels 1-4; Calling; Circle of Flame; Domination; Compulsion; Constrain Being; Hallucination; Commune with Spirits; Summon Entity; Summon Lesser Being; Close Rift', 'All healing powers (used for torture)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Charming host at first, quickly turning gleefully cruel; skilled at both physical and psychological torture.', 'Tiamat (secret information-for-favors arrangement)', NULL, 'Sadistic goddess of the dead who imprisons and tortures anyone unlucky enough to enter her hellish realm.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.52-53');
  'nergal', 'Nergal', NULL, 'Prince of Discord', 'rifts', 'Deity', '12th level ley line walker', 12, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Varies from 6 to 24 feet (1.8-7.3 m)', 'Varies with height.', '{"IQ":18,"ME":23,"MA":17,"PS":43,"PP":17,"PE":21,"PB":9,"Spd":88}', 800, 1000, 18000, 900, NULL, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":1,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":4,"roll":4}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic. M.D.C. reduced to 3,600 on Rifts Earth. +28 to S.D.C. damage; +6 save vs horror factor; +4 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics. Can cast fire ball, circle of fire and globe of daylight three times a day at no P.P.E. cost, at 15th-level sorcerer strength. A coward who flees any fight he might lose.', '[{"name":"Track Human","pct":98},{"name":"Hunting","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Concealment","pct":98},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":98},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":98},{"name":"Art","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Akkadian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Sumerian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Assyrian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Persian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Gobbley","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98}]', 'W.P. Sword, W.P. Knife, W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Energy Rifle; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft, sees/turns invisible, regenerates 1D6x10 MDC/melee, animates 1D4x100 dead, teleports self 74%/dimensional 45%.', 'All spells levels 1-4; Domination; Horrific Illusion; Compulsion; Memory Bank; Wisps of Confusion', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Magic sword (crimson blade, indestructible, 4D6 M.D.); Triax particle beam rifle; Vibro-knife; Assorted techno-wizard devices; Magic scale armor (red, 1000 M.D.C., weightless)', NULL, 'Sadistic and cunning when scheming for war, but a craven coward in real combat who bullies only the outmatched.', 'Tiamat; Apsu (formerly)', NULL, 'Ereshkigal''s consort, a war-loving god of plague and destruction now scheming to plunge Rifts Earth into conflict.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.53-54');
  'lilith', 'Lilith', NULL, 'Bringer of Misery', 'rifts', 'Unique demon creature', '8th level sorcerer', 8, 'Miscreant', NULL, '5 feet, 9 inches (1.75 m)', '145 lbs (65 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":22,"MA":23,"PS":35,"PP":21,"PE":21,"PB":25,"Spd":33}', 100, 180, 1800, 500, 200, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":1,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic. M.D.C. not reduced on Rifts Earth. +20 to S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs horror factor; +4 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics. Horror Factor: none unless enraged, 14 when her demonic nature is revealed.', '[{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":89},{"name":"Tracking","pct":85}]', 'All rogue at 98%; W.P. Sword, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Nightvision 100 ft, sees/turns invisible, regenerates 1D6x10 MDC/minute, teleports self 43%/dimensional 29%; shapeshifts into any humanoid female form.', 'All spells levels 1-2; Armor of Ithan; Fool''s Gold; Shadow Meld; Calling; Domination; Compulsion; Apparition; Life Drain', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A calculating seductress who wrecks relationships to claim men as lovers, then flees when confronted by real power.', 'Tiamat; Nergal; Jahi (friendly rival)', NULL, 'A demonic seductress descended from a Dar''ota, formerly loyal to Apsu and Tiamat, who ruins nations and lovers for sport.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.54');
  'gilgamesh', 'Gilgamesh', NULL, 'The Demigod', 'rifts', 'Demigod variant', '18th level warrior, 7th level ley line walker, 5th level priest of the Pantheon of Sumer (lapsed; cannot perform clerical miracles)', 18, 'Anarchist', NULL, '7 feet (2.1 m)', '400 lbs (180 kg) of pure muscle', '{"IQ":18,"ME":22,"MA":20,"PS":50,"PP":24,"PE":29,"PB":17,"Spd":44}', 112, 250, 1123, 325, 73, NULL, 11, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":4,"strike":7,"parry":13,"dodge":13,"pull":4,"roll":8}', 'Alt: 2 attacks by magic. M.D.C. does not change on Rifts Earth. +35 to S.D.C. damage; +7 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic; +7 save vs poison/drugs/disease; +4 save vs psionics. Psionics equal to a 7th level psychic.', NULL, 'All wilderness, espionage and domestic skills at 98%; Acrobatics, Wrestling, Boxing, Athletics (no percentage printed); W.P. Knife, W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Spear; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Bio-regenerates 1D6x10 MDC/minute; ages slowly (possible 600-year lifespan); supernatural strength, endurance, speed and agility.', 'All spells levels 1-4; Eyes of Thoth; Swim as a Fish; Impervious to Energy; Teleport: Lesser; Invisibility: Superior; Mystic Portal; Close Rift; Dimensional Portal', 'Mind Block; Telepathy; Astral Projection', NULL, NULL, 'Sword of Gilgamesh (greatest rune weapon, 1D6x10 M.D., doubled vs dragons and vampires, indestructible, telepathic link, dimension-warping powers); Enchanted Scale Armor (1,000 M.D.C., regenerates 50 M.D.C. per day)', NULL, 'Magnetic and supremely self-confident, a natural leader who assesses foes shrewdly; now unsettled by fear of death.', 'Endiku', 'Ishtar (spurned her, provoking retaliation)', 'Legendary Babylonian demigod-king, now an interdimensional wanderer questing for immortality after realizing he could age and die.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.55-56');
