  'ea', 'Ea', 'Erghoul', NULL, 'rifts', 'Altered Sowki', '9th level witch and 6th level mind melter', 9, 'Miscreant', NULL, '7 feet tall (2.1 m)', '300 lbs (136 kg)', '{"IQ":26,"ME":27,"MA":24,"PS":43,"PP":20,"PE":22,"PB":12,"Spd":66}', NULL, NULL, 980, 610, 230, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":1,"strike":6,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":4}', 'or 3 attacks by magic instead of 6 physical; +28 to S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic and poison; +8 save vs psionics', '[{"name":"Recognize Enchantment/Possession","pct":70},{"name":"Operate Computers","pct":90},{"name":"Demon and Monster Lore","pct":98},{"name":"Palming","pct":75},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Akkadian","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":98}]', 'Read mystic symbols (no percent given); W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol; Combat Skills: Natural', 'Superior hawk-like vision 2 miles, nightvision 600 ft, third eye sees invisible, understands/speaks all languages, immune to mind control/possession, summons demons, bio-regenerates 2D6 M.D.C. per 5 minutes, animates and turns 2D6 dead, immune to poison and fire.', 'All spells levels 1-15 via Pact of Union, including spells of legend and temporal magic equal to a 6th level caster', 'Meditation; Mind Block; Sense Magic; Speed Reading; Summon Inner Strength; Total Recall; Object Read; Hypnotic Suggestion; Telepathy; Bio-Manipulation; Mind Bolt; Psi-Sword', NULL, NULL, 'Enchanted sword: 6D6 M.D., indestructible', NULL, 'Megalomaniacal, ambitious and greedy; believes his arrogance is justified by his power.', NULL, NULL, 'Erghoul-Katet, an ambitious altered Sowki who made a pact with Apsu and now leads the Dark Council disguised as the Babylonian god Ea.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.59');
  'enlil-the-bio-borg', 'Enlil', 'Krellon the Magnificent', 'The Bio-borg Warlock', 'rifts', 'Altered Human', '18th level air and water warlock, 8th level ley line walker, 7th level bio-wizard', 18, 'Aberrant', NULL, '5 feet, 9 inches tall (1.7 m)', '297 lbs (133 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":16,"MA":14,"PS":22,"PP":14,"PE":17,"PB":5,"Spd":15}', NULL, NULL, 460, 321, 63, NULL, 11, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":4}', 'or two attacks by magic; Chest Amalgamate can strike four times per melee on its own; +7 to S.D.C. damage; +7 to save vs magic', NULL, 'Anthropology, archaeology, chemistry, advanced math, lore: demons and monsters, lore: faerie, full understanding of magic, all at 98 percent; Dragonese/Elven, Latin, Akkadian, and 7 native-dimension languages, all at 98 percent; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Basic', 'Chest Amalgamate: crab-creature fused to body (160 M.D.C. of his total), deadens pain, needs little sleep, immune to poison/gas/disease, fast healing; extended lifespan (3500 yrs); hawk-like vision; summons water/air elementals.', 'All elemental air and water spells; All spells levels 1-4; Energy Disruption; Eyes of Thoth; Fly; Superhuman Strength; Teleport: Lesser; Invulnerability; Metamorphosis: Human; Negate Magic; Control/Enslave Entity; Create Golem', 'Mind Block; Speed Reading; Total Recall; Telemechanics', NULL, NULL, 'Lesser Rune Weapon (sword): I.Q. 10, telepathic link, 4D6 M.D. (doubled vs creatures of magic); Talisman: holds 400 P.P.E., recharges 10 P.P.E./hr (doubled at ley line nexus); TW Modified Sunaj Assassin armor (repainted purple): 110 M.D.C., enchanted with Armor of Ithan at 12th level (120 M.D.C.), usable 6x/day', NULL, 'Not sadistic: hunts power without pause, yet takes no pleasure in killing or cruelty; cold except toward fellow mages; the ends justify the means.', 'Ea/Erghoul; Tiamat the Younger', NULL, 'Once the warlock-king Krellon, now a bio-wizard-altered insectoid creature impersonating the Sumerian god Enlil as a Dark Council leader.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.59-61');
  'tiamat-the-younger', 'Tiamat', NULL, 'The Younger, Mistress of Dragons', 'rifts', 'Great Horned Dragon', '23rd level dragon, 12th level ley line walker', 23, 'Miscreant', NULL, '25 feet (7.6 m) tall, 70 feet (21.3 m) long', '30 tons', '{"IQ":22,"ME":26,"MA":20,"PS":48,"PP":18,"PE":25,"PB":22,"Spd":60}', NULL, NULL, 6500, 900, 120, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'alt attacks: 4 fire breath + 4 physical, or 3 by magic; flying Spd 190 (130 mph/208 kmph); +33 to S.D.C. damage; +9 save vs horror factor; +9 save vs magic; +10 save vs psionics', NULL, 'Demon/monster lore, faerie lore, all wilderness, domestic, detect concealment, detect ambush, track human, all at 98 percent; Dragonese/Elven, Latin, Greek, Akkadian, Sumerian, Egyptian, Palladium Northern and Southern tongue, American, Spanish, all at 98 percent; W.P. Sword, W.P. Heavy Weapons; Combat Skills: Natural', 'Nightvision, excellent color vision, sees/turns invisible, fast bio-regeneration, resists fire and cold (half damage), teleports self and dimensionally, at-will metamorphosis into human or animal form.', 'All spell magic levels 1-11; Restoration; Resurrection; Dimensional Portal', 'All sensitive, physical, and healing powers; Bio-Manipulation; Psi-Sword', NULL, NULL, 'None, relies on powers', NULL, 'Mean, tough, bold, cunning and arrogant; enjoys intimidating lesser beings and impressing others with her stolen identity.', 'Ea/Erghoul; Enlil/Krellon', 'Styphon the Black', 'A dragon who took the true goddess Tiamat''s name and reputation; now the strongest of the Dark Council.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.61-62');
  'gilgamesh-the-wanderer', 'Gilgamesh', NULL, 'The Wanderer', 'rifts', 'Unknown - Supernatural', '19th level warrior', 19, 'Principled', NULL, '7 feet tall (2.1 m)', '400 lbs (180 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":22,"MA":22,"PS":50,"PP":25,"PE":30,"PB":17,"Spd":44}', NULL, NULL, 1600, 200, 120, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":7,"parry":13,"dodge":13,"pull":6,"roll":6}', '+35 to S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs magic; +8 save vs poison and disease; +8 save vs horror factor; +6 save vs psionics', NULL, 'All wilderness and espionage at 98 percent; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Heavy Weapons; Robot Combat: Basic; Athletics, Boxing, Wrestling; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Martial Arts', 'Fast bio-regeneration, resistant to fire (half damage), sees the invisible, has keen senses.', NULL, 'All sensitive powers; Mind-Block Auto-Defense', NULL, NULL, 'Flameblade: rune weapon, I.Q. 14, telepathic link, Scrupulous alignment, Psi-Sword 1D6x10 M.D., Psi-Bolts 6D6 M.D. up to 1000 ft (305 m); Enchanted Scale Mail: 1500 M.D.C., weightless', NULL, 'A paladin of justice: kind, generous and merciful; sharp and deadly in combat; troubled by amnesia and fear he may be the ancient king.', 'Endiku Longhair/Marcus Meleagrus', NULL, 'An amnesiac warrior bearing the name of legendary King Gilgamesh; unclear whether he is the original, a clone, or an impostor.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.62-63');
  'endiku-longhair', 'Endiku Longhair', 'Marcus Meleagrus', NULL, 'rifts', 'Atlantean', '10th level Undead Slayer', 10, 'Principled', NULL, '7 feet (2.1 m)', '196 lbs', '{"IQ":17,"ME":21,"MA":15,"PS":24,"PP":16,"PE":16,"PB":17,"Spd":20}', NULL, NULL, 352, 316, NULL, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":4,"roll":4}', '+8 save vs horror factor; +5 save vs magic and poison; +6 save vs psionics', NULL, 'Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Martial Arts', 'Senses vampires at 1000 ft (305 m), senses ley lines/nexuses/rifts, can operate dimensional pyramids; further powers come from tattoos.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'K-E4 Plasma Ejector; K-4 Laser Pulse Rifle; 3 silver knives; wood cross; dozen wooden stakes and mallet; Tattoo, Heart Impaled by Wooden Stake: immune to vampire bite/mind control, PPE 15, 10 hrs; Tattoo, Turn Dead (Cross): as spell, PPE 15, 10 min; Tattoo, Heart In Chains (Invulnerability): body withstands 750 M.D.C., PPE 40, 1 hr 40 min; Tattoo, Cloud In Chains (Air Powers): PPE 50, 10 min; Tattoo, Rose and Thorny Stem (Healing): 3 healing touches/min, PPE 30, 10 min; Tattoo, Phoenix (Super Healing): restores 50 HP/50 S.D.C. or 100 M.D.C., can revive dead at a cost, PPE 124, instant; Tattoo, Eye of Mystic Knowledge: recognize magical writings, PPE 20, 1 hr 40 min; Tattoo, Simple Weapons (Sword/Spear/Axe/Mace/Staff/Knife): each a tattoo, PPE 2, 5 hrs; Tattoo, Simple Animals (Horse/Wolf/Elephant/Eagle/Chimpanzee): PPE 15 (30 for elephant), 10 hrs or until slain; Tattoo, Chain With Broken Link: grants P.S. 30 (supernatural), PPE 30, 50 min; Tattoo, Knight in Armor: transparent armor 200 M.D.C., PPE 25, 5 hrs; Tattoo, S.D.C. Shield: 200 S.D.C., A.R. 13, PPE 2, 5 hrs; Tattoo, Heart With Tiny Wings (run): superhuman speed 190/130 mph, PPE 10, 5 hrs; Tattoo, Monsters: Pegasus (180 M.D.C.), Peryton (190 M.D.C.), Gryphon (86 M.D.C.), Fury Beetle (800 M.D.C.)', NULL, 'Noble, dignified, good-humored but rigidly by-the-book; a chivalrous knight, merciless only toward supernatural monsters.', 'Gilgamesh the Wanderer', NULL, 'An Atlantean Undead Slayer who adopted the name of Gilgamesh''s mythic companion Endiku after befriending the amnesiac wanderer.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.64-65');
  'zeus', 'Zeus', NULL, 'Roman: Jupiter, God of the Skies', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level air and water warlock, 15th level ley line walker, 15th level warrior', 20, 'Anarchist', 'Over 5,000 years old', '6 to 60 feet (1.8 to 18.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":28,"ME":30,"MA":25,"PS":50,"PP":25,"PE":35,"PB":24,"Spd":60}', 3000, 7000, 100000, 15000, 700, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":3,"strike":7,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"pull":6,"roll":6}', 'M.D.C. 20,000 on Rifts Earth and most dimensions; Horror Factor 17 in giant form; alt: 3 spells per melee instead of physical/lightning; +35 S.D.C. damage; +10 save vs horror factor; +8 save vs all magic; +8 save vs psionics; generates lightning bolts at will (1D6x10 M.D., no P.P.E. cost, range 4000 ft); weather control 3x/day, 100 mile radius, storms about 3D6 minutes', '[{"name":"Literacy: Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Faerie","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Italian","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Latin","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Gobblely","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Splugorth","pct":65}]', 'Most normal skills of little interest to Zeus; minimum 60 percent chance on any skill attempted; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Expert', 'Fast bio-regeneration incl. limb regrowth, nightvision, sees/turns invisible, immune to fire/cold/poison, at-will metamorphosis and teleport (self and others), turns 1D6x100 dead, healing touch.', 'All spells levels 1-10; Anti-Magic Cloud; Create Magic Scroll; Remove Curse; Summon Fog; Amulet; Metamorphosis: Mist; Calm Storms; Summon Rain; Summon Storm; Summon Lesser Being; Summon Entity; Close Rift; Sanctum; Restoration; Dimensional Portal; Transformation; All Air and Water Elemental spells', 'All Healing, Sensitive, and Physical Powers (8th level master psionic)', NULL, NULL, 'The Aegis: indestructible shield, viewers flee unless they save vs Horror Factor 16; Bolts of the Cyclops: 2D6x10 or 3D6x10 M.D., range 2000 ft (610 m)', NULL, 'Loud, commanding and self-absorbed; a notorious seducer; defends Olympia and worshippers mainly out of pride and self-interest.', 'Herakles; the Hundred-Handed; Thoth; Hades', NULL, 'King of the Olympian gods, god of sky and storm; powerful and vain, rarely acting unless his own interests are threatened.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.66-68');
  'herakles', 'Herakles', NULL, 'Roman: Hercules, God of Strength and Heroes', 'rifts', 'Deity (former demigod)', 'Equal to a 12th level warrior', 12, 'Unprincipled', '3,500', '6 feet, 10 inches (2.08 m)', '500 lbs (225 kg); all muscle', '{"IQ":13,"ME":25,"MA":20,"PS":70,"PP":24,"PE":30,"PB":16,"Spd":50}', 1500, 2500, 40000, 100, 100, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":8,"strike":7,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"pull":8,"roll":8}', 'M.D.C. 8,000 on Rifts Earth and most dimensions; Horror Factor 12 only if he demonstrates his strength or is recognized; +45 S.D.C. damage; +8 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics; berserker rage when angered beyond endurance, lasts 3D4 minutes', '[{"name":"Language: Greek","pct":90},{"name":"Language: Italian","pct":90},{"name":"Language: Euro","pct":90},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":90},{"name":"Language: Dragonese","pct":90},{"name":"Language: American","pct":65},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":65}]', 'W.P. Sword, W.P. Archery and Targeting, W.P. Bow, boxing, athletics, wrestling, climb, swim, demon and monster lore, detect ambush, detect concealment, first aid, horsemanship, tracking; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Martial Arts', 'Fast bio-regeneration incl. severed limbs, sees invisible, keen vision/hearing, resists poison and fire/cold, does not breathe air, superhuman leaping, healing touch.', NULL, 'Sense Magic; Mind Block; Mind Block Auto-Defense', NULL, NULL, 'Bow of Herakles: indestructible, requires Str 24+; 2D6 M.D. for others (range 1200 ft) or 1D4x10 M.D. for Herakles (range 2000 ft), triple damage vs demons/vampires/alien intelligences; Fur of the Nemean Lion: no damage from sharp weapons, half from energy, full from blunt/kinetic/explosive', NULL, 'Friendly, cheerful and generous when content; sullen or given to violent rages when provoked; brave to the point of recklessness.', 'Zeus', NULL, 'Son of Zeus and a mortal woman, a demigod raised to full godhood after surviving the Hydra''s poison; mighty and impulsive champion of Olympia.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.68-69');
  'hera', 'Hera', NULL, 'Roman: Juno, Goddess of Women', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level sorceress', 15, 'Miscreant (formerly Unprincipled, then Anarchist)', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":22,"ME":16,"MA":16,"PS":23,"PP":18,"PE":20,"PB":22,"Spd":44}', 1500, 3000, 45000, 3000, 600, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"roll":4}', 'M.D.C. 9,000 on Rifts Earth; alt: two attacks by magic instead of five hand to hand; +8 S.D.C. damage; +7 save vs magic; +7 save vs psionics; Insanities: obsessed with making Zeus suffer, paranoid of Zeus/Herakles/Gods of Light, schizophrenic (hears taunting voices)', NULL, 'All Domestic, Dragonese/Elf, ancient Greek, all at 98 percent; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Basic', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleports (self and dimensional), fast bio-regeneration.', 'All magical spells, levels 1-15', 'All sensitive and healing powers', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vain, shallow, self-centered, vengeful and manipulative; consumed by jealousy of Zeus''s lovers; now deals freely with evil to get revenge.', NULL, 'Zeus''s mortal lovers (targets of her revenge plots)', 'Wife of Zeus and Olympian goddess of women, driven to psychotic jealousy by his infidelities; secretly plots against his lovers.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.69-70');
  'hades', 'Hades', NULL, 'Aidoneous; Roman: Pluto or Plouton; God of Death', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level sorcerer, necromancer and diabolist', 15, 'Aberrant', NULL, '6 to 60 feet (1.8 to 18.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":24,"ME":28,"MA":23,"PS":40,"PP":21,"PE":24,"PB":12,"Spd":88}', 3000, 5000, 80000, 7000, 100, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":1,"strike":9,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'M.D.C. 16,000 on Rifts Earth; alt: three attacks by magic instead of six hand to hand; +25 S.D.C. damage; +14 save vs horror factor; +8 save vs magic; +8 save vs psionics', NULL, 'Demon/monster lore, all domestic, all technical, and all languages, at 98 percent; Combat Skills: Hand to Hand Assassin', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleports (self and dimensional), fast bio-regeneration, turns/animates 2D6x100 dead at will, summons ghouls/tomb worms/mares/hundred-handed demons once per 24 hours.', 'All spells levels 1-15; All necromantic spells; All wards', 'Mind Block Auto-Defense', NULL, NULL, 'Helmet of Invisibility: total invisibility even vs see-the-invisible, 2 hrs/day; Magical Plate Armor: 2,000 M.D.C.; Impaler Rune Sword: drinker of souls/life essences, animated spike-finger appendages that can crawl (Spd 12, climb 80 percent)', NULL, 'Cold-hearted and grim; sees his cruel duty as jailor and torturer as sacred; does not consider himself evil, just dutiful.', 'Zeus; Poseidon', 'Succor-Bemoth (demon lord)', 'Zeus''s brother, god of death and ruler of the underworld, warden of Tartarus, the prison between dimensions that holds the Titans.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.70-72');
  'cerberus', 'Cerberus', NULL, 'Hound of Hades', 'rifts', 'Supernatural Creature', NULL, NULL, 'Aberrant', NULL, '10 feet (3 m) tall, 30 feet (9 m) long', '8 tons', '{"IQ":13,"ME":18,"MA":16,"PS":40,"PP":22,"PE":28,"PB":3,"Spd":88}', 150, 400, 4000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":5,"dodge":5}', '+12 to save vs horror factor, +7 to save vs magic, +7 to save vs psionics.', NULL, NULL, 'Nightvision 2000 ft, sees/turns invisible at will, bio-regenerates 2D4x10 M.D.C./minute; spits burning acid poison (2D6 M.D./round for 1D6 rounds unless washed off).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The archetypal, dedicated guardian; sometimes lonely, and enjoys talking to strangers who do not try to pass him.', NULL, NULL, 'Three-headed dog with a serpent for a tail who guards the entrance to the Underworld; intelligent and can speak.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.72-73');
  'charon', 'Charon', NULL, 'The Ferryman', 'rifts', 'Supernatural Being/Godling', NULL, NULL, 'Aberrant', NULL, '7 feet tall (2.1 m)', '180 lbs (81 kg)', '{"IQ":25,"ME":25,"MA":26,"PS":34,"PP":23,"PE":37,"PB":4,"Spd":66}', 150, 400, 5000, 100, NULL, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":1,"strike":8,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"roll":6}', '+19 to S.D.C. damage; +12 to save vs horror factor; immune to all psionic and magical attacks; magic/psionic weapons (incl. psi-swords) do 1/4 damage; non-magic energy attacks do half damage; regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C. per melee round within 50 ft of the River Styx.', '[{"name":"Pilot Boat: Small","pct":98},{"name":"Swim","pct":98}]', 'Speaks all languages; Combat Skills: Natural Abilities.', 'Nightvision 1000 ft (sees in total darkness), sees invisible, sees through illusions; immune to magic/psionics; regenerates M.D.C. near the River Styx.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Charon''s Boat (magically resizes for up to 100 passengers, indestructible, cannot sink); Charon''s Rod (indestructible wood staff, usable as club/staff, 4D6 M.D.)', 'Demands steep payment for passage (far more than average travelers can afford); only 1 credit/coin if sent for by Hades.', 'Never displays emotion; collects payment, ferries passengers, and fights to kill if crossed.', NULL, NULL, 'Skeletal, silent ferryman of the River Styx who guards passage into Hades'' realm and will not ferry demons.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.73');
  'athena', 'Athena', NULL, 'Goddess of War & Wisdom; Roman: Minerva', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level warrior, 10th level ley line walker', 20, 'Principled', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":27,"ME":26,"MA":26,"PS":48,"PP":26,"PE":25,"PB":24,"Spd":88}', 1500, 3000, 45000, 5000, 1000, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":5,"strike":8,"parry":13,"dodge":13,"pull":6,"roll":6}', 'M.D.C. is 9,000 on Rifts Earth. +33 to S.D.C. damage; +10 to save vs horror factor, +6 to save vs magic, +7 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic instead of hand to hand.', '[{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Concealment","pct":98},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":98},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":98},{"name":"All Domestic","pct":98},{"name":"All Technical","pct":98},{"name":"All Languages","pct":98}]', 'W.P. Archery and Targeting, W.P. Knife, W.P. Sword, W.P. Spear, boxing and wrestling; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleports 98% (dimensional 65%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.; can take the shape of a human woman or man, or of an owl, at will.', 'All spells levels 1-8; Banishment; Mystic Portal; Amulet; Remove Curse; Close Rift; Dimensional Portal', 'All sensitive powers; All healing powers; Empathic Transmission; Mind Block Auto-Defense; Psi-Shield; Psi-Sword', NULL, NULL, 'Athena''s Spear (holy weapon; 6D6+6 M.D., doubled vs supernatural/magical creatures incl. dragons, tripled vs Splugorth/vampire intelligences; 70% remove curse; turns 1D6x10 dead 85%; returns when thrown, range 2000 ft); Athena''s Holy Shield (indestructible, weightless, 2D4 M.D. thrown like a discus); Magic Armor (400 M.D.C., lightweight)', NULL, 'Wise, compassionate, even-tempered; sometimes preachy, but always striving to be fair; befriends honorable, compassionate warriors.', 'Gods of Light from all pantheons; Norse god Balder; Babylonian Marduk; Egyptian Isis; Persian Ahura Mazda; Apollo; Artemis; Herakles (occasionally); Minions: none formally, but often accompanied by spirits of light, True Atlanteans, and dragons of good alignment', 'Demons; Vampires; Alien intelligences; Forces of Darkness', 'Zeus'' daughter, Olympian goddess of war and wisdom; a brilliant tactician who prefers guiding heroes to direct combat.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.73-75');
  'apollo', 'Apollo', 'Apollo Lyceius', 'The Archer, God of Light', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level warrior, ley line walker and healer', 20, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with height', '{"IQ":24,"ME":23,"MA":24,"PS":46,"PP":28,"PE":25,"PB":25,"Spd":88}', 1100, 3500, 56000, 8000, 1000, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":9,"parry":12,"dodge":12,"pull":5,"roll":5}', 'M.D.C. is 11,200 on Rifts Earth. +31 to S.D.C. damage; +10 to save vs horror factor, +6 to save vs magic, +6 to save vs poison and drugs, +5 to save vs psionics. Alt: ten bow and arrow attacks, or three attacks by magic, per melee.', '[{"name":"Anthropology","pct":90},{"name":"Mechanical Engineering","pct":90},{"name":"Automotive Mechanics","pct":90},{"name":"Locksmith","pct":90},{"name":"Basic Electronics","pct":90},{"name":"Radio: Basic","pct":90}]', 'Knows all medical skills (except cybernetics), all domestic, all technical, all computer skills; magically speaks all languages; W.P. Sword, W.P. Spear, W.P. Archery and Targeting; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees/turns invisible, flies, teleports 98% (dimensional 65%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.; can bless arrows into gold, has prophetic dreams, and a limited resurrection power.', 'All spells levels 1-15', 'All sensitive and healing powers; P.P.E. Shield; Psi-Shield; Psi-Sword; Pyrokinesis; Telemechanics; Mind Block Auto-Defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Sun Bow (greatest rune weapon; I.Q. 15, scrupulous, telepathic; fires solar-plasma arrows 2D6x10 M.D., tripled vs vampires/alien intelligences, +4 to strike, range 4000 ft; casts invulnerability, impervious to energy, armor of Ithan, or negate magic 3x/day at 15th level)', NULL, 'Friendly and tolerant, but merciless to major criminals, vampires and monsters; compassionate healer and master musician.', 'Artemis (sister); Athena; Indian sun god Surya; Spirits of light; Undead slayers; Cyber-knights; Sincere champions of light', 'Giants; Evil dragons; Vampires; Splugorth (opposes their expansion)', 'Sun god of Olympia; patron of arts, law, archery, music, prophecy and healing, and an implacable foe of giants and dragons.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.75-76');
  'aphrodite', 'Aphrodite', NULL, 'Goddess of Love; Roman: Venus', 'rifts', 'Deity', '12th level ley line walker', 12, 'Anarchist', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with height', '{"IQ":16,"ME":18,"MA":23,"PS":19,"PP":20,"PE":18,"PB":30,"Spd":30}', 800, 1000, 18000, 2000, 200, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"roll":4}', 'M.D.C. is 3,600 on Rifts Earth. Horror Factor is 12 for awe, or full horror factor when she is angry. +4 to S.D.C. damage; +4 to save vs horror factor, +3 to save vs magic, +3 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic.', '[{"name":"All Domestic","pct":98},{"name":"Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Atlantean","pct":98}]', 'Speaks 12 other languages at 98%; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, changes physical size like most gods, teleports 78% (dimensional 45%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.', 'Spells levels 1-4; Sleep; Domination; Compulsion; Eyes of Thoth; Magic Pigeon; Reduce Self; Tongues; Dispel Magic Barrier; Locate; Hallucination; Dimensional Portal', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, 'The Golden Girdle (any male in her line of sight falls in love unless he saves vs magic 16+; usable up to 3x/24 hours)', NULL, 'Vain, lazy and spoiled; plays dumb and helpless to manipulate men, and dislikes attractive women around her.', 'Eros (son)', 'Ishtar and other love goddesses (rivals); Jilted lovers; Interdimensional slavers who want to capture her', 'Most beautiful and lecherous Olympian goddess, married to Hephaestus but famed for countless affairs.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.76-77');
  'hermes', 'Hermes', NULL, 'Messenger of the Gods; Roman: Mercury', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level ley line walker, diabolist, scholar and alchemist, 8th level operator/mechanic, and a 6th level techno-wizard', 15, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '5 feet 10 inches (1.78 m)', '175 lbs (79 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":21,"MA":24,"PS":30,"PP":27,"PE":19,"PB":24,"Spd":590}', 500, 1000, 15000, 1000, 100, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":8,"parry":10,"dodge":10,"roll":5}', 'M.D.C. is 3,000 on Rifts Earth. +6 additional to dodge when using his magic sandals; +15 to S.D.C. damage; +4 to save vs magic, +4 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic. Considered a minor psionic.', '[{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":95},{"name":"Detect Concealment","pct":95},{"name":"Acrobatics","pct":95},{"name":"Swimming","pct":95},{"name":"Wrestling","pct":95}]', 'All Wilderness, rogue, piloting, science, technical and domestic skills at 95%; W.P. Sword, W.P. Staff; Hand to Hand: Expert.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleports 98% (dimensional 65%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.; uncanny tracker (98%, even across dimensions; 85% to find a target''s new dimension).', 'All spells levels 1-15; Techno-wizard magic; Wards; Circles; Magic Lore', 'All sensitive powers (minor psionic)', NULL, NULL, 'The Winged Sandals (flight, 400 mph/Mach 3, creates mini-rift for dimensional travel); The Winged Headband (sense of direction, senses nearest rift/nexus, locates any god of Olympia); The "Herminator" rail gun pistol (techno-wizard; burst does 1D4x10 M.D., single round 1D4 M.D.; range 1000 ft; 100-round payload; requires supernatural P.S. 20+ or mortal P.S. 30+)', NULL, 'Mischievous, wisecracking trickster with a great sense of humor; a loyal friend who loves helping travelers.', 'Hindu god Krishna; Gilgamesh the Wanderer; Endiku Longhair; Minions: none, too busy exploring and having fun to collect worshippers', NULL, 'Youthful herald and messenger god of Olympia, patron of merchants