k.', 'Minions: forming a new band of demigod/godling hunters, preferring mutant animals and females', 'World-destroying Mechanoids', 'Twin sister of Apollo; virgin goddess of the hunt and wilderness who protects animals and the ecology.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.79-80');
  'ares', 'Ares', NULL, 'God of War; Roman: Mars', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level warrior and 6th level line walker and psychic', 15, 'Miscreant', NULL, '6 to 24 feet (1.8 to 7.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":18,"ME":22,"MA":21,"PS":42,"PP":24,"PE":27,"PB":17,"Spd":60}', 2000, 3000, 50000, 500, 200, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":9,"initiative":4,"strike":9,"parry":12,"dodge":12,"pull":4,"roll":6}', 'M.D.C. is 10,000 on Rifts Earth. +27 to S.D.C. damage; +13 to save vs horror factor, +6 to save vs magic, +6 to save vs poison/disease, +4 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic. Considered a major psionic. Aura of Discord: 300 ft radius, save vs magic 14+ or filled with rage/blood lust; psi-stalkers, psychic sensitives, violent or evil characters are -4 to save.', '[{"name":"Literacy: Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Latin","pct":98},{"name":"Boxing","pct":98},{"name":"Wrestling","pct":98},{"name":"Climbing","pct":98},{"name":"Gymnastics","pct":98},{"name":"Swimming","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":65},{"name":"Detect Concealment","pct":65},{"name":"Tracking (humanoids and animals)","pct":65},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":65},{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":65},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":65},{"name":"Pick Pockets","pct":65},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":65},{"name":"Demolitions","pct":65}]', 'Magically speaks all languages at 85%; knows ALL weapon proficiencies; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Bio-regenerates 1D4x100 M.D.C./minute and regrows lost limbs/eyes; keen hawk-like vision; nightvision 100 ft; resistant to fire/cold; leaps 50 ft; dimensional teleport 75% (known dimensions only).', 'Spells levels 1-5 (equal to a 6th level Ley Line Walker)', 'All healing and physical powers (6th level strength)', NULL, NULL, 'Holy Sword (1D6x10 M.D., doubled vs vampires/intelligences/demons; expels demons 89% lesser/44% greater); Golden magic plate armor (3,000 M.D.C., manufactured by Hephaestus, self-repairing over 24 hrs, indestructible)', NULL, 'Coarse, loud and hot-tempered bully; relishes fighting and cruelty, but may flee when outmatched.', 'Persian god Verethraghna; Egyptian Anhur; Minions: none, prefers to fight alone or incite others to fight for him', 'Herakles (defeated him when Ares was only a demigod)', 'Son of Zeus and Hera; brutal Olympian god of war who lives for combat and blood lust, resented by other gods.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.80-82');
  'dionysus', 'Dionysus', NULL, 'God of Wine & Festivals; Roman: Bakchos or Bacchus', 'rifts', 'Deity', '10th level sorcerer', 10, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '5 feet, 11 inches (1.8 m)', '190 lbs (85.5 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":18,"MA":23,"PS":38,"PP":20,"PE":23,"PB":24,"Spd":66}', 1100, 2100, 32000, 2000, 150, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'M.D.C. is 6,400 on Rifts Earth. Horror Factor is 10 normally, or 13 in a drunken rage. +23 to S.D.C. damage; +5 to save vs horror factor (+10 when drunk), +5 to save vs magic (incl. faerie food), +5 to save vs poison, +3 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic.', '[{"name":"Wilderness Survival","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Holistic Medicine","pct":98},{"name":"Botany","pct":98},{"name":"Chemistry","pct":98},{"name":"Chemistry: Analytical","pct":98}]', 'All domestic, all wilderness, and all lores; magically speaks all languages; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleports 76% (dimensional 65%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.; can turn drinks alcoholic, transform people into animals, commune with/summon animals, and control land fertility over a 1000-mile radius.', 'Spells levels 1-8', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, 'Thyrsus (staff from a Millennium Tree; 1000 M.D.C., 120 P.P.E., fire immunity for wielder; 6D6 M.D. weapon, doubled vs supernatural creatures if wielded by a demigod or greater; casts repel animals, turn dead, circle of protection, remove curse, and constrain being 3x/24 hrs at 10th level)', NULL, 'Easygoing ''happy drunk,'' charming and engaging, but sometimes belligerent and violent when intoxicated.', 'Hindu god Soma; Faerie peoples; Some Irish gods; Minions: virtually all faerie folk, usually accompanied by 1D6 of satyrs, nymphs, centaurs, psi-stalkers, simvan and zembahk', 'Egyptian god Bes (former friend, now evil and destructive)', 'Demigod raised to full divinity by Zeus; Olympian god of wine, festivals and fertility, friend to faerie folk.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.82-83');
  'hephaestus', 'Hephaestus', NULL, 'God of Blacksmiths & Artisans; Roman: Vulcan', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level weaponsmith, 14th level sorcerer and fire warlock, 4th level techno-wizard and operator', 20, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '5 feet, 8 inches (1.73 m)', '400 lbs (180 kg)', '{"IQ":25,"ME":21,"MA":22,"PS":55,"PP":17,"PE":26,"PB":6,"Spd":5}', 1260, 3300, 45600, 3500, 200, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'M.D.C. is 9,120 on Rifts Earth. +8 to save vs horror factor, +7 to save vs magic, +4 to save vs psionics. Alt: two attacks per melee if using magic. Only three unarmed attacks are printed for him (no kick).', '[{"name":"Electrical Engineer","pct":98},{"name":"Carpentry","pct":98},{"name":"Fishing","pct":98},{"name":"Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Greek","pct":98}]', 'All science, technical and mechanical skills; uses the tongues spell to converse in other languages; W.P. Blunt; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees invisible, teleports 66% (dimensional 62%), bio-regenerates M.D.C.; immune to heat/fire (even magic fire), half damage from energy, full damage from magic.', 'All spells levels 1-15; All elemental fire spells', 'All physical powers; Pyrokinesis; Hydrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Invisible Net (only the wielder can see it; 200 M.D.C.; magic/M.D. weapons do only 1/4 damage; escapable by P.S. 40+); Chains of Binding (unbreakable; only the owner or Hephaestus can open the manacles); Arrows of Slaying (+1 to strike, fly 25% farther, 1D4x10 M.D.; used by Eros, Ares and other gods of Olympia)', NULL, 'Quiet and reserved unless discussing craft with another smith; mistreated for much of his life, but fiercely loyal to his few friends.', 'Minions: apprentices trained at his Olympia workshop, including lesser and greater Cyclops, Asgardian Dwarves, normal Dwarves, Atlanteans, Jotan giants, and occasional humans', NULL, 'Son of Hera, born crippled and cast out of Olympia; master smith who forges weapons and armor for the gods.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.83-84');
  'eros', 'Eros', NULL, 'God of Love; Roman: Amor or Cupid', 'rifts', 'Deity', '8th level ley line walker and herbologist', 8, 'Anarchist', NULL, '5 feet, 10 inches (1.78 m)', '175 lbs (78.75 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":20,"MA":25,"PS":28,"PP":23,"PE":20,"PB":25,"Spd":66}', 500, 1000, 15000, 800, 300, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"roll":4}', 'MDC 3,000 on Rifts Earth (alt to 15,000 base); +9 to strike with bow and arrow (alt to +5); +4 save vs magic; +4 save vs psionics; 8 attacks/shots with bow instead of 4 hand to hand or 2 by magic.', NULL, 'All domestic skills 98%; magically speaks all languages; W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees invisible, turns invisible at will, dimensional teleport 65%, bio-regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C. per minute.', 'All spells levels 1-3; Multiple image; Escape; Sleep; Reduce: self; Fly as the eagle; Time hole', 'All sensitive powers; Empathic transmission', NULL, NULL, 'Magic Bow and Arrows (6000 ft range, mega-damage or love arrows); Arrows of Slaying (+1 strike, flies 25% farther, 1D4x10 M.D.); Pink Arrows (amorous compulsion); Golden Arrows (love compulsion); Lead Arrows (loss of interest)', NULL, 'Friendly, warm, crafty, whimsical; obsessed with matchmaking and romance.', NULL, NULL, 'Aphrodite''s grown son, god of romantic love, married to the demigoddess Psyche; currently arranging an unlikely match at an Olympian''s request.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.84-85');
  'poseidon', 'Poseidon', NULL, 'God of the Sea; Roman: Neptune', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level air, water and earth warlock, 10th level ley line walker', 20, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6 to 60 feet (1.8 to 18.3 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":24,"ME":24,"MA":22,"PS":50,"PP":21,"PE":23,"PB":20,"Spd":110}', 2300, 6000, 83000, 8000, 600, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":6,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":4,"roll":4}', 'MDC 16,600 on Rifts Earth (alt to 83,000 base); +35 S.D.C. damage; +11 save vs horror factor; +5 save vs magic; +6 save vs psionics; three attacks by magic or psionics as alternate. Special powers: create earthquakes at will (15th-level effect, no P.P.E. cost), summon storms/tidal waves (15th level, no P.P.E. cost, once/minute), commune with sea life (summon fish/mammals/predators), summon elementals (air, earth, water) at will.', NULL, 'Demon/monster lore; all domestic 98%; horsemanship (incl. sea creatures); magically knows all languages; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 2000 ft, sees/swims underwater at any depth, breathes water, impervious to cold/poison, resists electricity, invisibility, teleport 98%, bio-regenerates 1D6x100 M.D.C./min.', 'All air, water and earth spells (equal to 20th level warlock); All spells levels 1-15 (equal to 10th level wizard)', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, 'Poseidon''s Trident (rune weapon, I.Q. 16, 2D6x10 M.D., thrown 1000 ft, spell magic); The Sea-Conch of Storms (casts summon storm 4x/day, no P.P.E. cost)', NULL, 'Stern overlord who awes mortals; aloof but fatherly toward demigods and creatures he favors.', 'Triton; other water deities (including some from alien pantheons)', 'The Mechanoids', 'Zeus''s brother, god of the sea, earthquakes and horses; co-ruler of Olympia, sworn to avenge his people against the Mechanoids.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.85-86');
  'triton', 'Triton', NULL, 'Tamer of the Storms', 'rifts', 'Deity (lesser god)', '9th level warrior, 7th level water warlock', 9, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6 to 30 feet (1.8 to 9 m)', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":18,"ME":17,"MA":16,"PS":40,"PP":22,"PE":19,"PB":15,"Spd":88}', 500, 900, 14000, 400, 140, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":4,"roll":4}', 'MDC 2,800 on Rifts Earth (alt to 14,000 base); +25 S.D.C. damage; +10 save vs horror factor; +3 save vs magic; +4 save vs poison; +2 save vs psionics; two attacks by magic as alternate.', NULL, 'Navigation, all sciences, Dragonese/Elf, Greek, Atlantean, 5 additional languages, all at 96%; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/breathes underwater, resists electricity, dimensional teleport 45%, bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C./min, can metamorphose into two-legged human.', 'All water spells levels 1-6', 'All sensitive powers', NULL, NULL, 'Horn of the Ocean (casts storm/sea spells 3x/24hr, equal to 10th level warlock); Sea Sword (1D6x10 M.D., thrown 800 ft, magically returns)', NULL, 'Serious, soft-spoken, noble; more at home with sea life than land dwellers.', 'Poseidon (father and liege)', NULL, 'Son of Poseidon and the sea goddess Amphitrite; serves as Poseidon''s herald and enforcer, defending sea creatures across the Megaverse.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.86');
  'cronus', 'Cronus', NULL, 'Chief of the Titans; Roman: Saturn', 'rifts', 'Titan (Alien Intelligence)', '20th level ley line walker and mind melter', 20, 'Diabolic (formerly Aberrant)', NULL, '60 feet (18.3 m) tall, mountain of black tentacles and eyes', 'Over 80 tons', '{"IQ":26,"ME":24,"MA":18,"PS":60,"PP":21,"PE":26,"PB":2,"Spd":88}', 2000, 4000, 60000, 30000, 2000, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":8,"strike":6,"parry":10,"dodge":3,"pull":2,"roll":1}', 'MDC 30,000 on Rifts Earth (alt to 60,000 base); cannot be surprised/attacked from behind (eyes all around), can attempt to parry any attack; +14 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic; +8 save vs psionics; impervious to mind control; four psionic or three magic attacks as alternates. Special: Absorb Life Energy - devours beings, steals their P.P.E./I.S.P./skills and 1/10 of their M.D.C.; victim saves vs psionics (14, or 10 if supernatural) or is erased.', NULL, 'Most skills too menial for the creature, who relies on natural powers and skills stolen from victims; knows all languages magically; Combat Skills: Natural Abilities.', 'Nightvision 2000 ft, sees all light spectrums/radiation, sees invisible/through illusions, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 88%, bio-regenerates 1D6x100 M.D.C./min, immune to cold/heat/disease/poison, splits essence into 1D4 fragments, animates/turns 1D6x100 dead.', 'All spells levels 1-15', 'ALL, including super psionics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Evil incarnate, cruel and unforgiving; half-mad from imprisonment and obsessed with revenge.', NULL, 'all gods of Olympia (if freed)', 'Chief of the Titans, an inhuman alien intelligence who once swallowed his own children to steal their power; imprisoned in Tartarus.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.88-89');
  'prometheus', 'Prometheus', NULL, 'Protector of Humankind (Titan)', 'rifts', 'Titan', '18th level ley line walker and scholar', 18, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '8 to 40 feet (2.4 to 12.2 m) tall', 'Varies with size', '{"IQ":26,"ME":28,"MA":27,"PS":57,"PP":23,"PE":28,"PB":19,"Spd":66}', 1000, 3000, 40000, 5000, 1000, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":7,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":6,"roll":4}', 'MDC 20,000 on Rifts Earth (alt to 40,000 base); +8 save vs magic; +8 save vs poison; +8 save vs psionics; three attacks by magic as alternate.', NULL, 'All domestic, espionage, scientific, technical, communication, navigation, and all common piloting skills at 95%; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees/turns invisible, climb 70/80%, swim/teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 65%, impervious to fire/heat, resists cold, bio-regenerates 1D4x100 M.D.C./min.', 'All spells levels 1-15', 'All healing powers; Pyrokinesis; Telemechanics; P.P.E. shield; Psi-shield; Psi-sword', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Noble, humorous, fatherly teacher figure; honorable but willing to trick powerful enemies to help mortals.', 'Apollo; Athena; Ahura Mazda (Persian); Marduk (Sumerian); Brahma (Hindu)', 'forces of evil and enemies of humankind; the Western Empire (avoids working with, sees as evil)', 'A second-generation Titan who sided with Zeus against Cronus and secretly taught mortals magic; tortured by Zeus, later freed by Herakles.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.89-90');
  'atlas', 'Atlas', NULL, 'Titan of Strength', 'rifts', 'Titan', '18th level warrior', 18, 'Aberrant', NULL, '20 to 100 feet (6 to 30.5 m) tall', 'Varies with size (200 tons at maximum size)', '{"IQ":6,"ME":18,"MA":18,"PS":90,"PP":20,"PE":32,"PB":4,"Spd":88}', 2000, 6000, 80000, 200, NULL, NULL, 17, '{"attacks":9,"initiative":2,"strike":6,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'MDC given as 80,000 (40,000) - likely 40,000 on Rifts Earth as with other entries; +9 save vs horror factor; +10 save vs magic; +10 save vs psionics.', NULL, 'Demon/monster and faerie lore, swimming, climbing, gymnastics at 98%; wrestling, body building, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Sword; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 65%, bio-regenerates 1D4x100 M.D.C./min, impervious to heat/cold/disease/poison, can leap 500-1000 ft depending on size.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Slightly dimwitted but fearsome; likes feeling things crunch; delusional that he must hold up the world.', NULL, 'Zeus; Herakles', 'The strongest Titan, condemned to hold up a mountain in Tartarus after leading the Titans'' war against the gods; seeks revenge if released.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.90-91');
  'hecate', 'Hecate', NULL, 'The Great Sorceress', 'rifts', 'Titaness', '20th level alchemist, ley line walker, necromancer, diabolist and summoner; 7th level temporal wizard', 20, 'Aberrant', NULL, '6 to 40 feet (1.8 to 12.2 m)', 'Varies with size (her magic armor grows/shrinks with her)', '{"IQ":29,"ME":24,"MA":20,"PS":52,"PP":19,"PE":21,"PB":16,"Spd":110}', 1000, 2000, 30000, 10000, 160, NULL, 19, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":2,"roll":4}', 'MDC 15,000 on Rifts Earth (alt to 30,000 base); +12 save vs horror factor; +6 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics; an incredible four attacks by magic as alternate.', NULL, 'All technical, science and domestic skills at 98%; magically knows all languages; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees/turns invisible, flies at will, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 65%, bio-regenerates 1D4x100 M.D.C./min, needs no air, impervious to heat/cold/poison.', 'All magical spells, summonings, mystic symbols, necromancy and temporal magic; All circles and wards (plus some of her own devising)', 'All sensitive powers; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'Living Armor of Bone (7,000 M.D.C., regenerates 2D6x10 M.D.C./min; stinger tail 6D6 M.D. plus paralyzing venom; retractable blades +3D6 M.D.; bio-field 750 M.D.C.; horn beam 1D6x10 M.D.); Vast rune weapons, bio-wizard parasites/symbiotes, magic potions in a dimensional pocket', NULL, 'Cruel, power-hungry; obsessed with gaining magical knowledge and avoiding mortality.', NULL, 'the Splugorth (mostly reconciled after centuries of pursuit)', 'Former teacher of Zeus and the mightiest sorceress of the ancient age; now wanders dark realms hunting forbidden lore and ultimate power.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.91-92');
  'jupiter', 'Jupiter', 'Unknowable (and unpronounceable)', 'Evil Intelligence', 'rifts', 'Supernatural Intelligence', '12th level Line Walker, Diabolist, and Summoner', 12, 'Aberrant', '15,000 years old', '9 feet (2.74 m) humanoid form; 15 ft (4.6 m) tall / 20 ft (6 m) diameter true form', '1000 lbs (450 kg) humanoid form; 40 tons true form', '{"IQ":24,"ME":28,"MA":24,"PS":45,"PP":22,"PE":30,"PB":3,"Spd":45}', 4000, 8000, 30000, 8000, NULL, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":1,"strike":7,"parry":6,"dodge":-2,"roll":-2}', 'Horror Factor 12 in humanoid form (alt to 18 true form); +30 S.D.C. damage; +12 save vs horror factor; +10 save vs magic; +10 save vs psionics; highly resistant to psionics, impervious to mind control/possession; three attacks by magic as alternate. M.D.C. by Location: Giant Eye 1000 (500 S.D.C.), Small Eyes x7 300 each (150 S.D.C. each), Tentacles x6 1500 each (750 S.D.C. each), Main Body 30,000 (also human-form MDC; 8000 S.D.C./4000 hit points in S.D.C. environment), Energy Aura 10,000 M.D.C. (2000 S.D.C.; regens 100 M.D.C./20 S.D.C. per hour). Vulnerable to silver (double damage), rune weapons (triple damage), Millennium Tree wood (ten times damage).', NULL, 'Literate in Dragonese/Elven, Greek, Latin at 98%; demon and monster lore 98%; Combat Skills: Natural Abilities.', 'Bio-regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C./min, regrows limbs/eyes in 48 hrs, nightvision 1000 ft, sees invisible, impervious to poison, resists heat/cold, needs no air, immune to mind control, teleports self 88% and others, fragments essence into five pieces.', 'All spell invocations, wards and circles (12th level proficiency)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rune weapons and magical equipment (rarely used)', NULL, 'Cold, calculating, sadistic; feeds on fear, sorrow, pain and despair; delights in manipulation.', 'Witches (its priests, see Rifts Conversion Book One); Hercules the Destroyer; Mamers; Mercury', 'Pluto (rival vampire intelligence)', 'An alien intelligence posing as a Roman-named god to exploit mortals'' emotions, orchestrating wars and disasters across history.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.94-95');
  'hercules-the-destroyer', 'Hercules', 'Hyrr''Klean', 'the Destroyer; Demon Servant of Jupiter', 'rifts', 'Demon', '10th level Fighter (natural magic)', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, '7 feet (2.1 m)', '600 lbs (270 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":18,"MA":10,"PS":40,"PP":20,"PE":25,"PB":9,"Spd":40}', 150, 250, 1500, 400, 500, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":5,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":4,"roll":8}', '+9 save vs horror factor; +7 save vs magic; +4 save vs psionics; two attacks by magic as alternate.', NULL, 'Track humans 60%, swim 98%, climb 98%/88%, wilderness survival 98%, land navigation 98%, demon and monster lore 98%; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Energy Rifle; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Nightvision 90 ft, sees/turns invisible, tracks by smell 55%, dimensional teleport 60%, bio-regenerates 4D6 M.D.C./min, fire resistant, magically speaks all languages.', 'Sense magic; Sense evil; Fear; Armor of Ithan; Chameleon; Turn dead; Tongues; Ley line transmission', 'All healing and sensitive powers (5th level proficiency)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Violent, murderous, sadistic hatchet-man; bullies those weaker, rarely speaks.', 'Jupiter (master)', 'Endiku Longhair (Atlantean undead slayer); a man claiming to be King Gilgamesh', 'Jupiter''s demon enforcer and bodyguard, sent to punish unfaithful followers; currently hunting an Atlantean who once defeated him.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.95-96');
  'mamers', 'Mamers', 'Myrroo-kee', 'Demon Servant of Jupiter', 'rifts', 'Unique Demon servant', '15th level warrior and 4th level mage', 15, 'Aberrant', '2,000 years', '7 feet (2.1 m)', '400 lbs (180 kg)', '{"IQ":17,"ME":19,"MA":18,"PS":35,"PP":23,"PE":22,"PB":9,"Spd":60}', 100, 400, 3000, 300, 200, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":10,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":3,"roll":5}', '+10 save vs horror factor; +4 save vs magic; +2 save vs psionics.', NULL, 'ALL W.P.s; wilderness survival, tracking (humanoids/animals), detect ambush, detect concealment, intelligence, escape artist, demon/monster lore, swim, climb, all at 98%; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Bio-regenerates 6D6 M.D.C./min, nightvision 120 ft, sees/turns invisible, dimensional teleport 51%, fire resistant, magically speaks all languages.', 'All level one spells; Befuddle; Chameleon; Armor of Ithan; Magic net; Fire bolt; Fire ball; Repel animals; Swim as a fish; Astral projection; Ley line transmission; Escape; Heal wounds', 'All healing powers (4th level strength)', NULL, NULL, 'Spear (Greatest Rune weapon, soul drinker, animated/flying, thrown 1000 ft and returns, 1D4x10 M.D.); Shield (indestructible magic, +3 to parry, can parry energy blasts at -2); Sword (Rune Weapon, 6D6 M.D., eight standard rune abilities)', NULL, 'Arrogant, cruel; follows a strict warrior code; fights to the death unless Jupiter orders otherwise.', 'Jupiter (master); Ares (potential ally/friend)', 'Pluto and his vampire minions; Conservators', 'A demon raised to power by Jupiter to wage war on Pluto''s vampires; delights in slaughter and gladiatorial duels in Atlantis.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.96-97');
  'cupid', 'Cupid', 'Cree-Cree', 'Also known as Diaper Angel', 'rifts', 'Terlin', '12th level wizard', 12, 'Diabolic', NULL, '4 feet tall (1.2 m)', '120 lbs (54 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":20,"MA":25,"PS":17,"PP":19,"PE":14,"PB":20,"Spd":20}', 51, 200, 200, 220, NULL, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"roll":4}', 'Horror Factor 12 applies only once his true nature is discovered; +6 to strike with bow and arrow (alt to +4); +1 S.D.C. damage; +5 save vs horror factor; +5 save vs magic; +5 save vs psionics; two attacks by magic as alternate.', NULL, 'All technical and domestic skills at 98%; W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Keen hawk-like vision, can shrink to six inches tall, animates objects under 10 lbs, opens a dimensional portal to his private lair.', 'All spells levels 1-4; Escape; Horrific illusion; Mask of deceit; Invulnerability; Wisps of confusion', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Bow of Obsession (2D6 M.D., 1000 ft range, fires love/obsession or magic fire arrows)', NULL, 'Pretends mischievous innocence but is a cruel, murderous fiend when thwarted; flees uneven fights.', 'Jupiter (master); Hercules the Destroyer; Mamers; Seven Dread Micro Wizards of Chaos', NULL, 'A demonic Terlin posing as a cherubic love-god, using magic arrows to engineer disastrous romantic obsessions for his own amusement.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.97-98');
  'mercury', 'Mercury', 'Doesn''t have any -- an extension of Jupiter', 'The Messenger; an extension of the alien intelligence Jupiter', 'rifts', 'Alien Intelligence Fragment', '10th level assassin/warrior', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, '8 feet (2.4 m) tall', '190 lbs (42 kg, as printed)', '{"IQ":16,"ME":15,"MA":15,"PS":35,"PP":25,"PE":25,"PB":12}', 120, 400, 900, 200, NULL, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":7,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"roll":3}', '+20 S.D.C. damage; +12 save vs horror factor; +5 save vs magic; +1 save vs psionics; Speed 600 mph (960 km) running or Mach 4 flying; High-Speed Impact adds +4 M.D. per 20 mph (max +60 M.D.).', NULL, 'Detect ambush, tracking (humanoids), land navigation, wilderness survival, all at 98%; magically speaks all languages; Prowl 75%; W.P. Knife, W.P. Sword; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Keen hawk-like vision (sees a target from the air 5 miles away), nightvision 1000 ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C./min, flawless sense of direction.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Enchanted Sword (4D6 M.D.)', NULL, 'Cold, sadistic, with little independent personality; a fragment of Jupiter who obeys without question.', 'Jupiter (creator/greater-self); Hercules the Destroyer; Mamers', 'Pluto''s vampires', 'A demonic fragment of the alien intelligence Jupiter, created as messenger and assassin; destroyed bodies are recreated after 1D4 weeks.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.98');
  'pluto', 'Pluto', NULL, NULL, 'rifts', 'Vampire Intelligence', '10th level psychic and 6th level wizard', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, '120 feet (36.6 m) in diameter', '40 tons', '{"IQ":21,"ME":24,"MA":18,"PS":40,"PP":21,"PB":1,"Spd":12}', 800, NULL, NULL, 10000, 500, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":12,"initiative":6,"strike":8,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"roll":1,"damage":25}', 'M.D.C. by location (not a single value): Small Eyes(100)-5 each, Giant Eye(1)-300, Tentacles(12)-100 each, Main Body-4000; reducing main body to 0 halves attacks/initiative and leaves it open to surprise. Sneak attacks impossible, cannot be blinded, parries all attacks. +7 save vs magic, +7 save vs psionics, impervious to mind control and magic/psionic sleep and paralysis. Sunlight cuts all abilities 75% (50% if overcast).', '[{"name":"Demon/monster lore","pct":98},{"name":"Faerie lore","pct":98},{"name":"Recognize scent of human blood","pct":90}]', 'Combat Skills: Natural; speaks all languages, reads Dragonese/Elven.', 'Creates vampires; nightvision 4000ft; sees invisible/infrared/UV; smells blood 2 miles; fast regeneration; near-invulnerable except to magic, wood, silver, running/holy water.', 'All summoning and circle magic, close rift, dimensional portal, mystic portal, teleport: superior, time hole, restoration, calm storm, dispel magic barrier, negate magic, anti-magic cloud, create magic scroll, wind rush, calling, trance, domination, paralysis: lesser, cloud of smoke', 'All sensitive and healing powers, plus empathic transmission, group mind block, hypnotic suggestion, psi-shield, psi-sword', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Grotesque, poorly educated monster; did not seek godhood but now grudgingly lets Phobos exploit the misidentification.', 'Phobos', 'Jupiter; Hercules; Mercury; The Furies', 'A vampire intelligence long mistaken for the Greek underworld god, waging a covert war against Jupiter''s Dark Olympus pantheon.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.99');
  'phobos', 'Phobos', NULL, 'Renegade', 'rifts', 'Godling', '10th level godling', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Six feet, seven inches tall (2.0 m)', '260 pounds (117 kg)', '{"IQ":17,"ME":19,"MA":12,"PS":39,"PP":18,"PE":20,"PB":15,"Spd":23}', 80, 240, 261, 204, NULL, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":3,"roll":5,"damage":23}', '+5 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics.', '[{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":83},{"name":"Demon and monster lore","pct":98},{"name":"Land navigation","pct":89},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":93},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Ancient Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Spanish","pct":98}]', 'Boxing, Wrestling, athletics; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Energy Rifle; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Night vision 200ft; sees invisible; impervious to poison/drugs/toxins/disease/vampires; half damage from fire/cold; bio-regenerates 1D6x5 M.D.C./minute; turns invisible at will.', 'Equal to 10th level ley line walker: all level one spells, befuddle, detect concealment, chameleon, shadow meld, heavy breathing, levitation, armor of Ithan, energy bolt, fire ball, impervious to fire, paralysis: lesser, resist fire, telekinesis, blind, energy field, magic net, trance, apparition, impervious to energy, hallucination', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Crusader Armor (M.D.C. 55); Vibro-sword; Neural mace; C-27 heavy plasma cannon; Vampire killing equipment (mainly for show)', NULL, 'Bullying, sadistic godling who loves gaining trust and then betraying it; enjoys instilling fear.', 'Pluto', 'Reid''s Rangers (intended target)', 'A godling claiming to be Ares'' exiled son who infiltrates vampire-hunting groups for the vampire intelligence Pluto.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.100');
  'zeus-the-thunderer', 'Zeus', 'Trellacryth', 'the Thunderer', 'rifts', 'Thunder Lizard Dragon', '12th level Dragon, 8th level Air and Water Warlock', 12, 'Anarchist', '4,000 years old', '7 feet (2.1 m) in human form, 20 feet (6 m) tall and 45 ft (13.7 m) long in dragon form', '200 lbs (90 kg) in human form, 20 tons in dragon form', '{"IQ":23,"MA":21,"ME":20,"PS":30,"PP":19,"PE":26,"PB":20,"Spd":30}', 1500, 3000, 6500, 1000, 50, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3,"damage":15}', 'P.B. 18 in human form (20 in dragon form). Horror Factor 15 as a dragon, 10 in human form (not a single number). +9 save vs horror factor, +10 save vs magic, +7 save vs psionics. Power Punch counts as two attacks. Owns an immense personal treasure hoard (amount unspecified).', '[{"name":"Basic math","pct":98},{"name":"Advanced math","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: English/American","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Palladium World''s Southern and Western tongues","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Spanish","pct":98},{"name":"Forgery","pct":69},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":69},{"name":"Demon and monster lore","pct":98},{"name":"Faerie lore","pct":59},{"name":"Basic electronics","pct":98},{"name":"Computer operations","pct":98},{"name":"Streetwise","pct":76}]', 'W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 100ft; excellent color vision; sees/turns invisible; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C./min; resists fire and cold (half damage); teleport self 88%, dimensional teleport 60%; metamorphosis at will up to 48 hours.', 'All magic spells levels 1-5 plus animate & control dead, turn dead, exorcism, resurrection, remove curse, cure illness, heal wounds (equal to 12th level practitioner); all air and water elemental spells as an 8th level warlock', 'Has all sensitive and physical psi-powers', NULL, NULL, 'Lightning Spear (greater rune weapon, 1D6x10 M.D., double vs vampires/alien intelligences, thrown 300ft and returns, casts ball lightning/call lightning/darken the sky/whirlwind up to 4x/day at 6th level)', NULL, 'Calm, dignified, and fair leader; loyal to his Club members; speaks loudly, attacks in silence when angered; excellent strategist.', 'Hercules; Ares; Athena; Venus; Vulcan; Archimedes; Lord Hades', NULL, 'A Thunder Lizard dragon who has impersonated Zeus for centuries as the founder and leader of the Olympian Club.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.103-104');
  'hercules-of-olympus', 'Hercules', 'Herbert Rowland', 'of Olympus', 'rifts', 'Human Mutant', '8th Level Mutant (see Heroes Unlimited)', 8, 'Miscreant', '20', '6 feet (1.8 m)', '300 lbs (135 kg)', '{"IQ":11,"ME":14,"MA":9,"PS":32,"PP":18,"PE":22,"PB":12,"Spd":20}', 63, 280, 710, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":4,"roll":9,"damage":17}', '+4 save vs horror factor, +4 save vs magic, +34% save vs coma/death.', '[{"name":"Climbing","pct":98},{"name":"Swimming","pct":98},{"name":"Prowl","pct":70},{"name":"Pilot automobile","pct":98},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":75},{"name":"Literacy: American","pct":85}]', 'Acrobatics, body building, boxing, gymnastics, running (non-percentile); native tongue American; Hand to Hand: Expert.', 'None beyond his listed super powers.', NULL, NULL, 'Extraordinary Physical Strength; Invulnerability (regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C./minute; gases, drugs, chemicals, poisons, toxins and radiation have half potency/damage)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Loud, boastful bully who enjoys humiliating the weak; not a coward but retreats or negotiates against superior odds; grateful to Zeus.', 'Zeus (Trellacryth); Ares (Kaledon)', NULL, 'A human mutant accidentally pulled from his home dimension who briefly ruled as a false god before joining the Olympian Club as Hercules.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.103-104');
  'ares-the-renegade', 'Ares', 'Kaledon Arrellei', 'the Renegade', 'rifts', 'Human Tattooed Man', '8th level Tattooed Man (see Rifts Atlantis) with 19 tattoos', 8, 'Unprincipled', '28', '5 feet, 11 inches (1.8 m)', '190 lbs (85.5 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":15,"MA":10,"PS":15,"PP":21,"PE":15,"PB":11,"Spd":15}', 36, 245, 130, 224, NULL, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3}', 'Horror Factor 12 only when he reveals his tattoo powers. +7 save vs horror factor, +2 save vs magic, +2 save vs poison. M.D.C. 130 plus additional M.D.C. from tattoo magic.', '[{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":65},{"name":"Tracking","pct":75}]', 'W.P. Sword, W.P. Archery and Targeting, W.P. Blunt; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'See Tattoos (his abilities come entirely from his 19 magic tattoos, up to 6 active at once).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '19 magical tattoos (up to 6 active at once): 5 Simple Weapons, S.D.C. Shield, Two Swords Crossed, Sword Dripping Blood, Sword Covered in Flames, Horse, Cheetah, Dragonsaurus, Dragondactyl, Chain Encircling Skull, Eye with a Dagger In It, Eye of Knowledge, Heart Encircled in Chains, Skull Engulfed in Flames, Rose and Thorny Stem & Dripping Blood', NULL, 'Quiet, calculating former slave who studies foes like a chess player; obsessed with danger and combat; fast friends with Hercules.', 'Hercules (Herbert); Zeus (Trellacryth)', 'Splugorth', 'A former Splugorth warrior-slave who escaped and joined the Olympian Club as Ares despite knowing nothing of Greek myth.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.104-105');
  'archimedes', 'Archimedes', 'Zachary P. Tierney', 'The Mad Inventor', 'rifts', 'Human', '10th level rogue scientist and techno-wizard', 10, 'Anarchist', '23', '5 feet, 6 inches (1.68 m) tall', '130 lbs (58.5 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":14,"MA":12,"PS":13,"PP":9,"PE":14,"PB":11,"Spd":9}', 48, 25, NULL, 116, 41, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4}', 'M.D.C. is that of his Body Armor or the Atlas Assault Robot (no base humanoid M.D.C. given). No Bonuses line is printed for him. Horror Factor: None. Six hand to hand attacks when piloting the Atlas robot.', '[{"name":"Mechanical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Electrical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Science skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Technical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Paramedic","pct":98}]', 'Robot combat: basic; W.P. Energy Rifle, W.P. Energy Pistol, W.P. Automatic Rifle & Pistol; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Superhuman genius; learns and understands new concepts far beyond normal techno-wizard talent, possibly from a subtle mutation.', 'All first level spells plus ignite fire, fuel flame, fire bolt, call lightning, energy bolt, energy field, impervious to energy, telekinesis, armor of Ithan, magic net, impervious to fire, resist fire', 'Mind block, speed reading, total recall, telemechanics (minor)', NULL, 'Headjack; Amplified hearing; Gyro-compass', 'Suit of Gladiator Armor (armor of Ithan, impervious to energy); TW plasma rifle; TK-Machinegun; Atlas Assault Robot (piloted; see separate vehicle writeup, not a row here)', NULL, 'Immature, arrogant, brilliant inventor who annoys most people, but becomes a calm heroic warrior while piloting his Atlas robot.', 'Vulcan; Zeus (Trellacryth)', NULL, 'A displaced parallel-Earth inventor who became the Olympian Club''s chief weaponsmith and built the Atlas Assault Robot.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.105-106');
  'vulcan', 'Vulcan', 'Karid Ironspinner', 'The Techno-Wizard', 'rifts', 'Dwarf', '13th level techno-wizard', 13, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '4 feet, 3 inches (1.3 m) tall', '200 lbs (90 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":13,"MA":9,"PS":17,"PP":14,"PE":16,"PB":9,"Spd":10}', 1200, 200, 220, 89, 67, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":4,"roll":4,"damage":1}', '+4 save vs horror factor, +4 save vs magic, +2 save vs psionics; impervious to mind control. Horror Factor: None. M.D.C. 220 plus his Absurr Life Node (a symbiote with 500 M.D.C. that can transfer up to 497 M.D.C. to him if injured).', '[{"name":"Technical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Science skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Electrical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Mechanical skills (all)","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dwarven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Language: (3 other transdimensional languages)","pct":98}]', 'Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 90ft (total darkness); natural aptitude for weapon design/mechanics/manufacturing; Absurr Life Node symbiote grants energy bursts and empathic danger-warnings, impervious to mind control.', 'Knows all spells from levels 1-6 plus invulnerability, fly as the eagle, wind rush, wisps of confusion (as a 6th level caster)', 'Mind block, speed reading, total recall, telemechanics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Quiet, introverted engineer close only with Archimedes; enjoys chess; troubled by the innocent deaths he has witnessed in combat.', 'Archimedes; Zeus (Trellacryth)', 'Splugorth', 'A dwarven engineer bio-borged into a supernatural creature to serve as the Olympian Club''s Vulcan, now researching rune-weapon secrets.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.107-108');
  'athena-the-wise', 'Athena', 'Melia Strongoak', 'the Wise', 'rifts', 'Palladium World Titan (a giant)', '6th level warrior and ley line walker', 6, 'Anarchist', '17', '12 feet tall (3.6 m)', '600 lbs (270 kg)', '{"IQ":14,"ME":11,"MA":13,"PS":26,"PP":23,"PE":19,"PB":20,"Spd":23}', 100, 170, 170, 141, NULL, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":3,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":6,"roll":3,"damage":11}', '+4 save vs horror factor, +2 save vs magic. M.D.C. 170 plus whatever armor she wears.', '[{"name":"Cooking","pct":80},{"name":"Fishing","pct":85},{"name":"Climbing","pct":70},{"name":"Land navigation","pct":58},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":70},{"name":"Demon/monster lore","pct":70},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":98}]', 'W.P. Sword, W.P. Spear; Hand to Hand: Martial Arts.', 'Nightvision 90ft; excellent vision/hearing; sees invisible; bio-regenerates 4D6 M.D.C./min; turns 4D6 dead at will (80%); impervious to vampire bite; dimensional teleport at will (45%, +10% on a ley line, +20% at a nexus).', 'Death trance, globe of daylight, see the invisible, befuddle, chameleon, mystic alarm, armor of Ithan, impervious to fire, float in the air, astral projection, energy field, shadow meld, fly as the eagle, invulnerability, superhuman strength, energy disruption, fire ball, call lightning', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Techno-Wizard Armor (320 M.D.C.; armor of Ithan 80 M.D.C., impervious to energy, shadow meld, 3x/day); Holy Sword (made by the god Thoth; 4D6+6 M.D.; expels devils/demons at 89%/44%); Triax style giant laser rifle (5D6 M.D., 30-shot clip, 3000ft range)', NULL, 'Rebellious runaway titan who resents being controlled or advised; loves conning people with faux-wise advice; secretly lonely and homesick.', 'Herbert (Hercules); Trellacryth (Zeus); Keleborn; Shell (Lord Hades)', 'Venus', 'A rebellious lesser-titan who fled her strict paladin parents and joined the Olympian Club, playing the wise goddess Athena.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.108-109');
  'venus', 'Venus', 'Ylliriel Silverleaf', 'the Adventurer', 'rifts', 'Elf', '14th level ley line walker', 14, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '6 feet, 1 inch tall (roughly 1.85 m)', '157 lbs (70.6 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":14,"MA":11,"PS":13,"PP":17,"PE":15,"PB":25,"Spd":15}', 87, 32, NULL, 241, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+4 save vs horror factor, +5 save vs magic, +1 save vs psionics. M.D.C. depends on armor or magic worn (no base value given). Horror Factor: None.', '[{"name":"Detect ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Tracking (humanoids and animals)","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Atlantean","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Gobblely","pct":98}]', 'All domestic and wilderness skills at 98%; W.P. Archery and targeting, W.P. Sword, W.P. Staff, W.P. Energy Rifle; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 90ft (total darkness).', 'All spells levels 1-4 plus circle of flame, domination, escape, apparition, call lightning, compulsion, globe of silence, locate, curse: phobia, mute, summon rain, protection circle: superior', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Crown of Venus: Divine Aura (Horror Factor 10, +10 levels illusion, 600 M.D.C. force field, +10 saves vs magic/psionics/disease/horror, 3x/day, 3 hrs); Back-Up Force Field (60 M.D.C., 3x/day); Magic Power add-ons: superhuman strength, superhuman speed, swim as a fish, fly as the eagle (3x/day, 30 min each)', NULL, 'Pixie-humored, adventurous elf who robs and swindles the wicked rather than the hardworking; teases her admirer Hercules but is never cruel.', 'Zeus (Trellacryth)', 'Demons; Vampires; Supernatural monsters', 'A refugee elven sorceress from a demon-ravaged world who became the Olympian Club''s self-reliant, action-oriented Venus.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.109-110');
  'lord-hades', 'Lord Hades', NULL, 'also known as "Shell"', 'rifts', 'Temporal Raider (Alien)', '12th level temporal raider (see Rifts England)', 12, 'Anarchist', NULL, '8 feet tall (2.4 m)', '700 lbs (315 kg)', '{"IQ":22,"ME":20,"MA":13,"PS":21,"PP":22,"PE":18,"PB":6,"Spd":23}', 100, 230, 230, 320, 48, NULL, 13, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":7,"parry":8,"dodge":8,"pull":5,"roll":5,"damage":6}', '+8 to strike with energy blasts (vs +7 hand to hand). +8 save vs horror factor, +3 save vs magic, +3 save vs psionics.', '[{"name":"Pilot hover vehicles","pct":98},{"name":"Pilot jet aircraft","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":98},{"name":"Wilderness survival","pct":88},{"name":"Land navigation","pct":98},{"name":"Prowl","pct":85},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Language: American","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Greek","pct":98},{"name":"Language: (3 other interdimensional tongues)","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Senses dimensional rifts/portals/time holes; perceives 4th/2nd-dimensional beings, astral travelers, alien intelligence essences; ley line phasing; impervious to poison/toxins/heat/fire, doesn''t breathe; half damage from energy; bio-regenerates 4D6 M.D.C. per melee (costs an action). Energy Vampire: drains 15 S.D.C./HP per melee by touch; needs 1000 S.D.C./HP or 10 M.D.C. per day; can store up to six days of energy.', 'All temporal magic spells, all summoning magic, all magic spells levels 1-13 plus close rift, teleport: superior, dimensional portal', 'Alter aura, death trance, levitation, mind block, astral projection, empathy', NULL, NULL, 'Several Kittani energy weapons; Talisman with 100 P.P.E. for spell casting', NULL, 'Grim, otherworldly temporal raider mellowed by the Club; fond of Hercules and Venus; now mostly feeds on animals.', 'Hercules (Herb); Venus (Ylliriel); Zeus (Trellacryth)', 'A former pupil turned temporal wizard who robbed and betrayed him', 'A temporal raider nicknamed Shell who joined the Olympian Club after being betrayed by his own pupil, and now poses as the god of death.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.110-112');
  'varuna', 'Varuna', NULL, 'Guardian of the Universe', 'rifts', 'Deity (Elemental Being)', 'Elemental being with mastery of all 4 elements (air/water equal to 15th level warlock, earth/fire equal to 10th level warlock); 12th level ley line walker', 15, 'Aberrant evil (formerly Scrupulous)', NULL, '9 feet (2.7 m) tall', '600 lbs (183 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":20,"MA":20,"PS":30,"PP":19,"PE":23,"PB":21,"Spd":33}', 1000, 3000, 40000, 4000, 500, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":1,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":2,"roll":4,"damage":15}', 'M.D.C. reduced to 8,000 while on Rifts Earth; text says he ''used to have double'' his listed 40,000 M.D.C. +10 save vs horror factor, +5 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics.', '[{"name":"Demon/monster lore","pct":98},{"name":"Faerie lore","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Sanskrit","pct":98},{"name":"Language: (10 other Indian languages/dialects)","pct":98}]', 'All wilderness skills; W.P. Sword; Hand to Hand: Basic.', 'Nightvision 1200ft; sees invisible; impervious to heat/cold; resists fire (half damage); bio-regenerates 4D6x10 M.D.C./min; turns 1D6x100 dead; teleport self 88%, dimensional teleport 65%; healing touch (4D6); summons 1D4 lesser elementals of each type or one greater elemental of each type every 24 hours.', 'All elemental air and water spells at 15th level; all elemental earth and fire spells at 10th level', 'All sensitive powers plus mind block auto-defense and mind bolt', NULL, NULL, 'Magic Lasso (+3 to strike/ensnare; P.S. 60+ or a natural 20 needed to escape; -5 to strike/parry/dodge while ensnared, -10 and half speed if securely bound)', NULL, 'Once dignified and wise; now bitter, distracted, secretive and scheming after his demotion; more plotter than fighter.', 'Persian deities (limited); A Splugorth lord (secretly)', 'Brahma; Siva; Vishnu (the Divine Triad); Old demon lords', 'The demoted former chief of the Vedic Pantheon, now Brahma''s advisor, who secretly plots revenge against the ruling Divine Triad.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.113-114');
  'indra', 'Indra', NULL, 'God of Storms & Warriors -- Demon Slayer', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level air warlock and warrior, 10th level water warlock, 10th level sorcerer', 20, 'Anarchist leaning towards Miscreant', NULL, '20 ft (6 m)', '1000 lbs (450 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":22,"MA":19,"PS":40,"PP":23,"PE":21,"PB":20,"Spd":88}', 1300, 4000, 53000, 3000, 200, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":10,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":5,"roll":5,"damage":25}', 'M.D.C. is 10,600 on Rifts Earth (+2,000 more when he drinks soma). P.S. rises to 70 on soma (from 40). After soma: +11 to strike, +10 to parry/dodge, +11 save vs horror factor (vs the base +10 strike, +9 parry/dodge, +9 save horror listed). +5 save vs magic, +5 save vs psionics normally. Creates thunderous sound effects at will.', '[{"name":"Detect ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Detect concealment","pct":98},{"name":"Prowl","pct":98},{"name":"Holistic medicine","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship","pct":98},{"name":"Language: Dragonese/Elf","pct":98},{"name":"Language: (10 Indian dialects)","pct":98}]', 'All wilderness and domestic skills at 98%; Wrestling, Boxing; W.P. Sword, W.P. Blunt, W.P. Spear, W.P. Archery and targeting; Hand to Hand: Assassin.', 'Nightvision 600ft; hawk-like vision for miles; sees/turns invisible; half damage from energy/electrical attacks; bio-regenerates 3D6x10 M.D.C./min; teleport self 84%, dimensional teleport 80%; can fire one lightning bolt per melee (1D6x10 M.D., range 600ft), rarely used.', 'All air elemental magic as a 20th level warlock, all water elemental magic as a 10th level warlock, all spell magic levels 1-10 as a 10th level ley line walker', 'All sensitive powers plus hydrokinesis and electrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Vajra the Thunderbolt (rune weapon, 2D4x10 M.D., double vs evil/undead, changes shape to scepter/mace/discus, thrown 1000ft and returns, casts storm spells 3x/day at 10th level); Lightning Javelins (2D6x10 M.D., range 2000ft); Twin Daggers, lesser rune weapons (soul-drinking kris daggers, 2D4x10 M.D. each, can parry lightning bolts); Soma Potion (raises P.S. to 60 or 70, +2000 M.D.C., +1000 P.P.E., +400 I.S.P.; addictive); Plasma Rifle (100 M.D.C., 1D4x10 M.D./blast, range 3000ft, 24-blast payload); Indra''s Flying Disc (1000 M.D.C., Mach 8, silent, no weapon systems)', NULL, 'Arrogant, self-centered, foul-tempered demon slayer who masks his shortcomings well and craves being the leader/center of attention.', 'Varuna; Some Persian gods', 'Vishnu (considers him a traitor); Ahura Mazda (an old quarrel)', 'The Vedic god of storms and warriors, once Varuna''s second-in-command, now a soma-addicted demon slayer resentful of the ruling Divine Triad.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.114-115');
  'airavata', 'Airavata', NULL, 'The White Elephant', 'rifts', 'Supernatural Animal', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '15 feet tall (4.6 m) and 40 feet (12.2 m) long', '10 tons', '{"IQ":8,"ME":15,"MA":8,"PS":60,"PP":18,"PE":24,"PB":17,"Spd":88}', NULL, NULL, 3000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":2}', '+8 save vs horror factor, +8 save vs magic, +8 save vs psionics.', NULL, NULL, 'Regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C. per minute; serves as Indra''s mount, attacking known enemies of the gods on command.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A loyal, obedient mount that attacks the gods'' enemies on command.', 'Indra', NULL, 'Indra''s supernatural white elephant mount, which he rides into battle while hurling thunderbolts.', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.115');
  'tvashtri', 'Tvashtri', NULL, 'God of Magic', 'rifts', 'Deity', '15th level ley line walker, diabolist, summoner and dryad', 15, 'Anarchist', NULL, '8 ft (2.4 m)', '500 lbs (225 kg)', '{"IQ":26,"ME":19,"MA":22,"PS":29,"PP":16,"PE":22,"PB":18,"Spd":33}', 1100, 2500, 36000, 6000, 100, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":4,"roll":4,"damage":14}', '+7 save vs horror factor, +5 save vs magic, +3 save vs psionics; 7,200 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth; four attacks/melee if using magic or psionics instead of hand to hand', NULL, 'Hand to Hand: Basic; all technical, science and mechanical skills, Dragonese/Elf, 10 Indian dialects, all at 98%', 'Nightvision 200 ft, sees invisible, bio-regenerates 3D6x10 M.D.C./minute, teleports self 92%/dimensionally 86%; can negate magic and curses once per melee (save 12+)', 'All spells levels 1-13; Close rifts; Restoration; Dimensional portal; All circles and wards; Rune magic; Herb-making (soma potion)', 'Telepathy; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Shifter (indestructible golden wand, 1D6 M.D. blunt in his hands only; holds 5 greatest rune weapons - Sword of Atlantis, Impaler Sword, Dragon Thunderer, Dragon Rod, Crystal Fire Rod - see Rifts Atlantis)', NULL, 'Outwardly courteous but sarcastic and disrespectful; prefers guile, bribery and manipulation over open confrontation', 'Other gods of the Indian Pantheon (nominally)', 'Indra; Raksashas; other demons', 'Six-armed sorcerer-smith god who forged Indra''s rune weapons and the addictive soma potion; also called Visvakarma', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.116');
  'agni', 'Agni', NULL, 'God of Fire', 'rifts', 'Deity', '20th level fire warlock, 10th level sorcerer', 20, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '15 ft (4.6 m) tall', '400 lbs (180 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":26,"MA":24,"PS":30,"PP":26,"PE":24,"PB":19,"Spd":88}', 1000, 2000, 30000, 4000, 300, NULL, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":8,"parry":9,"dodge":9,"pull":1,"roll":4,"damage":15}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +6 save vs magic, +7 save vs psionics; 6,000 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth; 3 attacks/melee by magic or psionics; printed as "+1 to pull punch/damage" (single bonus applied to both); vulnerable to water/hydrokinesis (double dmg) and cold/ice-based magic (triple dmg)', NULL, 'Hand to Hand: Basic; wilderness survival, detect ambush, demon lore, elemental language, Dragonese/Elf, 8 Indian dialects, all at 98%', 'Impervious to flame/heat, disease, poison; sees infrared/heat (nightvision 1000ft); bio-regenerates 4D6x10 M.D.C./minute (2D6x100 if immersed in flame); summons 1D6 lesser fire elementals', 'All fire warlock spells at 20th level; Wizard spells levels 1-5; Cure illness; Time slip; Constrain being; Dispel magic barriers; Purification; Minor curse; Oracle; Wisps of confusion; Banishment; Mystic portal; Anti-magic cloud; Remove curse; Summon fog; Calm storms; Sanctum; Close rift; Impenetrable wall of force; Dimensional portal; Transformation', 'All healing powers; Pyrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'None - relies on his powers', NULL, 'Friendly and protective of mortals; impulsive fire-starter with a huge appetite; merciless toward bullies and evil beings', NULL, NULL, 'Elemental fire god, red-skinned with multiple heads and arms wreathed in flame; can take a humanoid form; messenger between gods and mortals', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.116-117');
  'soma', 'Soma', NULL, 'God of the Moon', 'rifts', 'Deity', '18th level herbalist/dryad, 15th level ley line walker and warrior', 18, 'Anarchist', NULL, '6 ft, 6 in (1.98 m)', '240 lbs (108 kg)', '{"IQ":19,"ME":23,"MA":21,"PS":35,"PP":19,"PE":20,"PB":18,"Spd":33}', 800, 1600, 24000, 3000, 240, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":3,"roll":3,"damage":20}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +4 save vs magic, +5 save vs psionics; 5,800 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth; 2 attacks/melee by magic; Intoxication Touch: injects a magic intoxicant (save vs magic 16+ or suffer hallucination/drunk/sleepy/sick/insanity, random roll 1-100%)', NULL, 'Hand to Hand: Expert; all medical (incl. cybernetic), wilderness and domestic skills; speaks/reads Dragonese/Elven; magically knows all languages ever spoken in India, all at 98%', 'Nightvision 1200 ft, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C./minute, teleports self 78%/dimensionally 75%, healing touch restores 4D6, resists poison/drugs (half effect)', 'All spells levels 1-4; Power of making magical potions', 'All sensitive powers; Bio-manipulation; Empathic transmission; Hypnotic suggestion; Mentally possess other; Mind wipe; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'Relies on his powers and potions (never uses soma on himself)', NULL, 'Moody and volatile, shifting between friendly/wise and savage/cruel; fights according to his current mood', NULL, NULL, 'Moon god who created the intoxicating soma drink, known for wildly shifting moods; also called Chandra; close friend of Indra', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.117-118');
  'surya', 'Surya', NULL, 'God of the Sun', 'rifts', 'Deity', '18th level ley line walker', 18, 'Principled', NULL, '12 ft (3.6 m) tall', '800 lbs (360 kg)', '{"IQ":24,"ME":23,"MA":23,"PS":30,"PP":19,"PE":25,"PB":21,"Spd":88}', 1500, 3500, 50000, 5000, 300, NULL, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":4,"roll":4,"damage":15}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +6 save vs magic, +5 save vs psionics; 10,000 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth; flies at Spd 220 (150 mph/241 km); 3 attacks/melee by magic; Light of Life (1x/day): allies within 300 ft heal 1D6x10, undead/entities/alien intelligences take 2D6x10 M.D. unless they flee, evil must save vs HF 16', NULL, 'Hand to Hand: Basic; demon lore, detect ambush, astronomy, Dragonese/Elf, Sanskrit, 10 Indian languages/dialects, all at 98%', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees invisible, bio-regenerates 2D6x10 M.D.C./minute, impervious to laser/light beams, turns 1D6x100 dead, teleports self 88%/dimensionally 65%, healing touch 4D6; can summon 1D6 Seraphs', 'All warlock fire and air spells at 15th level', 'All sensitive and physical powers; Mind block auto-defense; Electrokinesis; Hydrokinesis; Pyrokinesis; Telekinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Sun Staff (golden rune staff that glows like daylight; I.Q. 11, telepathic link; burns evil/selfish touchers 1D4x10 M.D.; 6D6 M.D., triple vs vampires/undead; casts blinding flash, swirling lights, circle of flame, fire ball, wall of flame 3x/24hrs at 10th level)', NULL, 'Stern and humorless; sees everything as black or white; merciless to known evil, lenient to misguided mortals', 'All forces of good', 'Most forces of evil; Vampires; Demons; Entities; Alien intelligences; Ravana (God of Darkness)', 'Sun god and guardian of law and order who enforces Brahma''s laws; implacable foe of vampires and demons; drives a seven-horse chariot', 'Rifts Conversion Book Two: Pantheons of the Megaverse p.118-119');
  'ratri', 'Ratri', NULL, 'Goddess of Shadows', 'rifts', 'Deity', '12th level ley line walker and warrior', 12, 'Principled', NULL, '5 ft, 10 in (1.8 m)', '170 lbs (76.5 kg)', '{"IQ":21,"ME":22,"MA":24,"PS":35,"PP":22,"PE":23,"PB":24,"Spd":38}', 800, 1200, 20000, 2000, 300, NULL, 16, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":10,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":6,"roll":4,"damage":20}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +5 save vs magic, +5 save vs psionics; 4,000 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth; flies at Spd 77 (52.5 mph/84 km); Horror Factor 16 evokes awe in good beings, fear in evil; 3 attacks/melee by magic; can summon 2D6 shadow beasts or 1D6 greater shadow beasts (110 M.D.C., I.Q. 9, 4D6 M.D. bite)', NULL, 'Hand to Hand: Assassin; detect ambush, detect concealment, holistic medicine, acrobatics, wilderness survival, Dragonese/Elf, 10 Indian languages, all at 98%', 'Nightvision 5000 ft (even magic darkness), sees shadow-melded beings/shadow beasts/invisible, senses vampires within 1000 ft, teleports 65%/dimensionally 55%, flies, doesn''t breathe, impervious to vampires, instantly recognizes disguised creatures of darkness', 'All spells levels 1-6; Constrain being; Dispel magical barriers; Negate magic; Globe of silence; Locate; Close rift', 'All sensitive powers; Empathic transmission; Hydrokinesis; Pyrokinesis; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Shadowblade (indestructible jet-black rune sword; I.Q. 10, telepathic link; burns evil alignments 1D4x10 M.D.; 2D4x10 M.D., doubled vs creatures of the night; casts globe of daylight, negate magic, anti-magic cloud, remove curse, extinguish flames 3x/24hrs at 10th level)', NULL, 'Benevolent, compassionate hunter of vampires and undead; relentless once decided on a course, avoids collateral harm', 'Surya; Vishnu; Isis; psi-stalkers; champions of Light', 'Vampires; undead; werebeasts; ghouls; evil gods of darkness', 'Goddess of shadows and night, feared slayer of vampires and undead who can summon shadow beasts; rumored bound by the Mayan 